{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FLXLFpN1wjrsiNqsGtB9uo","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '核心calibration claim不成立。Reframe为\"Empirical Identifiability Boundaries\n2\t  for Contamination-Aware IRT\"—— 系统性研究在什么条件下IRT校准才可行。exp-004仿真的identifiability map成为Core\n3\t  Contribution 1， exp-008 signal survival升级为Core，controlled SFT注入变为empirical validation证明仿真边界与真实数据吻合。\n4\t  叙事逻辑：在构建校准系统之前，先搞清楚它何时能工作。论文从\"we solve calibration\"转为\"we map when calibration is\n5\t  solvable\"。\n6\t\n7\t  '\n8\timagined_experiments:\n9\t- name: controlled_sft_injection\n10\t  plan_id: exp-001\n11\t  description: 'SFT contamination injection on Qwen2.5-0.5B/1.5B/3B at 5 dosage levels.\n12\t    在worst档下，注入本身成功但产生的score inflation pattern不干净—— 低dosage几乎无可测效应，高dosage效应被模型capacity限制截断。\n13\t\n14\t    '\n15\t  expected_results:\n16\t    sft_runs_completed: 15\n17\t    mmlu_score_inflation_0pct_baseline_acc: 0.47\n18\t    mmlu_score_inflation_5pct_pp: 0.8\n19\t    mmlu_score_inflation_25pct_pp: 2.1\n20\t    mmlu_score_inflation_50pct_pp: 4.5\n21\t    mmlu_score_inflation_100pct_pp: 8.2\n22\t    gsm8k_score_inflation_100pct_pp: 5.1\n23\t    arc_score_inflation_100pct_pp: 6.8\n24\t    humaneval_score_inflation_100pct_pp: 3.9\n25\t    inflation_monotonicity_spearman_mmlu: 0.9\n26\t    inflation_monotonicity_spearman_gsm8k: 0.7\n27\t    inflation_variance_across_seeds_std_pp: 2.8\n28\t    qwen_0_5b_inflation_at_100pct_pp: 11.5\n29\t    qwen_3b_inflation_at_100pct_pp: 5.8\n30\t    low_dosage_detectable_5pct: false\n31\t    low_dosage_detectable_25pct_marginal: true\n32\t  result_rationale: 'SFT注入机制本身可靠（paraphrase SFT是成熟技术），所以15个run都会完成。 但worst档的核心问题在这里开始显现：(1)\n33\t    0.5B模型capacity极小，SFT后memorization严重但泛化到benchmark format的能力弱， 导致inflation方差大；(2)\n34\t    5%dosage（<700 items for MMLU）在SFT数据中被稀释，inflation <1pp， 与random seed noise不可区分——这直接导致后续dose-response非单调的关键问题；\n35\t    (3) GSM8K/HumanEval因为是生成式评估（非选择题），paraphrase memorization的转化率低于MMLU， inflation更弱；(4)\n36\t    3B模型因pretraining更强，SFT的边际效应递减—— 表现为\"大模型inflation反而小于小模型\"的反直觉模式，给后续γ估计制造confounding。\n37\t    整体inflation pattern存在但noisy，为后续信号检测和IRT拟合埋下问题。\n38\t\n39\t    '\n40\t  tables:\n41\t  - name: 'Table: Score Inflation by Model × Dosage × Benchmark'\n42\t    columns:\n43\t    - model\n44\t    - benchmark\n45\t    - 0%\n46\t    - 5%\n47\t    - 25%\n48\t    - 50%\n49\t    - 100%\n50\t    rows:\n51\t    - - Qwen2.5-0.5B\n52\t      - MMLU\n53\t      - 42.3\n54\t      - 43.5\n55\t      - 45.8\n56\t      - 49.1\n57\t      - 53.8\n58\t    - - Qwen2.5-0.5B\n59\t      - GSM8K\n60\t      - 31.2\n61\t      - 31.5\n62\t      - 32.8\n63\t      - 34.1\n64\t      - 36.3\n65\t    - - Qwen2.5-0.5B\n66\t      - ARC-C\n67\t      - 38.1\n68\t      - 38.6\n69\t      - 40.2\n70\t      - 42.5\n71\t      - 45.9\n72\t    - - Qwen2.5-0.5B\n73\t      - HumanEval\n74\t      - 22.0\n75\t      - 22.1\n76\t      - 23.0\n77\t      - 24.2\n78\t      - 25.9\n79\t    - - Qwen2.5-1.5B\n80\t      - MMLU\n81\t      - 53.1\n82\t      - 53.6\n83\t      - 54.8\n84\t      - 56.5\n85\t      - 59.7\n86\t    - - Qwen2.5-1.5B\n87\t      - GSM8K\n88\t      - 48.5\n89\t      - 48.8\n90\t      - 49.9\n91\t      - 51.8\n92\t      - 53.2\n93\t    - - Qwen2.5-1.5B\n94\t      - ARC-C\n95\t      - 52.0\n96\t      - 52.4\n97\t      - 53.5\n98\t      - 55.1\n99\t      - 57.8\n100\t    - - Qwen2.5-1.5B\n101\t      - HumanEval\n102\t      - 35.4\n103\t      - 35.6\n104\t      - 36.5\n105\t      - 37.8\n106\t      - 39.1\n107\t    - - Qwen2.5-3B\n108\t      - MMLU\n109\t      - 61.8\n110\t      - 62.1\n111\t      - 63.0\n112\t      - 64.5\n113\t      - 67.0\n114\t    - - Qwen2.5-3B\n115\t      - GSM8K\n116\t      - 62.3\n117\t      - 62.5\n118\t      - 63.1\n119\t      - 64.2\n120\t      - 65.8\n121\t    - - Qwen2.5-3B\n122\t      - ARC-C\n123\t      - 60.5\n124\t      - 60.8\n125\t      - 61.6\n126\t      - 63.0\n127\t      - 65.2\n128\t    - - Qwen2.5-3B\n129\t      - HumanEval\n130\t      - 48.2\n131\t      - 48.4\n132\t      - 49.0\n133\t      - 50.1\n134\t      - 52.1\n135\t  figures_description:\n136\t  - 'Fig: Dosage-Inflation curves per model×benchmark. Key observation: 5% dosage\n137\t    points overlap with 0% error bars on most benchmarks. GSM8K/HumanEval curves noticeably\n138\t    flatter than MMLU. 0.5B shows highest absolute inflation but also highest variance.'\n139\t  analysis: '注入成功但暴露了两个worst档关键弱点：(1) 低dosage信号几乎不存在（5%不可检出，25%边缘）， 这意味着后续dose-response分析在低端会崩溃；(2)\n140\t    inflation幅度跨benchmark差异大 （MMLU最高~8pp，HumanEval仅~4pp），且与model scale反相关， 说明contamination\n141\t    effect不是一个简单的additive γ——它与ability θ交互， 这从根本上挑战了4PL+γ的additive model specification。\n142\t    但作为reframed论文的素材，这些结果反而有价值——\"仿真假设的uniform γ在真实数据中不成立\"是identifiability分析的重要发现。\n143\t\n144\t    '\n145\t- name: stage1_signal_pipeline\n146\t  plan_id: exp-002\n147\t  description: '4个检测信号（embedding retrieval, Min-K%++, ConStat, Self-Critique） 在exp-001所有模型上的计算。worst档下信号质量显著低于仿真中假设的AUC水平。\n148\t\n149\t    '\n150\t  expected_results:\n151\t    embedding_retrieval_auc_sft_100pct_avg: 0.72\n152\t    embedding_retrieval_auc_sft_5pct_avg: 0.54\n153\t    minkpp_auc_sft_100pct_avg: 0.68\n154\t    minkpp_auc_sft_5pct_avg: 0.52\n155\t    constat_auc_sft_100pct_avg: 0.66\n156\t    constat_auc_sft_25pct_avg: 0.57\n157\t    selfcritique_auc_sft_100pct_avg: 0.63\n158\t    selfcritique_auc_sft_5pct_avg: 0.51\n159\t    avg_signal_auc_across_all_conditions: 0.61\n160\t    signal_auc_variance_across_benchmarks: 0.008\n161\t    embedding_retrieval_auc_qwen0_5b_100pct: 0.75\n162\t    embedding_retrieval_auc_qwen3b_100pct: 0.69\n163\t    minkpp_fp_rate_at_90pct_recall: 0.45\n164\t    constat_requires_paraphrase_availability: true\n165\t    selfcritique_entropy_separation_cohens_d: 0.41\n166\t  result_rationale: 'worst档的核心机制在这里发力：(1) Embedding retrieval在100%dosage下表现尚可（AUC~0.72），\n167\t    因为语义相似性是最直接的信号——但它本质上检测的是\"题目是否在训练集里\"而非\"模型是否从中获益\"， 这导致了fundamental mismatch：高AUC不等于高因果信号质量；\n168\t    (2) Min-K%++在SFT后的token distribution shift中受到干扰，AUC降至0.68—— SFT本身（无论是否contaminated）改变了模型的perplexity\n169\t    landscape，造成confounding； (3) ConStat需要paraphrased版本的benchmark items，而这些paraphrases本身可能在SFT数据中出现过\n170\t    （因为我们的注入就是用paraphrases），导致original-vs-paraphrase gap被压缩，AUC仅0.66； (4) Self-Critique在SFT\n171\t    regime下最弱（AUC 0.63），因为SFT同时改变了模型的self-evaluation能力， 特别是对小模型（0.5B）self-critique本身就不可靠。\n172\t    关键问题：所有信号在5%dosage下AUC接近random（0.51-0.54）， 因为被contaminate的items太少（~70 items for\n173\t    MMLU 5%），信号被noise淹没。 跨benchmark方差小意味着问题不是benchmark-specific而是系统性的信号质量天花板。\n174\t\n175\t    '\n176\t  tables:\n177\t  - name: 'Table: Signal AUC Heatmap — Signal × Dosage (averaged across models and\n178\t      benchmarks)'\n179\t    columns:\n180\t    - signal\n181\t    - 5%\n182\t    - 25%\n183\t    - 50%\n184\t    - 100%\n185\t    rows:\n186\t    - - Embedding Retrieval\n187\t      - 0.54\n188\t      - 0.62\n189\t      - 0.68\n190\t      - 0.72\n191\t    - - Min-K%++\n192\t      - 0.52\n193\t      - 0.58\n194\t      - 0.64\n195\t      - 0.68\n196\t    - - ConStat\n197\t      - 0.51\n198\t      - 0.57\n199\t      - 0.62\n200\t      - 0.66\n201\t    - - Self-Critique\n202\t      - 0.51\n203\t      - 0.55\n204\t      - 0.59\n205\t      - 0.63\n206\t  - name: 'Table: Signal AUC by Model Scale at 100% Dosage (MMLU)'\n207\t    columns:\n208\t    - signal\n209\t    - Qwen-0.5B\n210\t    - Qwen-1.5B\n211\t    - Qwen-3B\n212\t    rows:\n213\t    - - Embedding Retrieval\n214\t      - 0.75\n215\t      - 0.73\n216\t      - 0.69\n217\t    - - Min-K%++\n218\t      - 0.71\n219\t      - 0.68\n220\t      - 0.65\n221\t    - - ConStat\n222\t      - 0.69\n223\t      - 0.67\n224\t      - 0.63\n225\t    - - Self-Critique\n226\t      - 0.58\n227\t      - 0.64\n228\t      - 0.66\n229\t  figures_description:\n230\t  - 'Fig: 4×4 AUC heatmap (signal × dosage) with color gradient from red (0.50) to\n231\t    green (0.80). Dominated by orange/yellow tones, only top-right corner (embedding×100%)\n232\t    reaches green. Clear dosage gradient visible in all signals.'\n233\t  - 'Fig: Per-item score distributions (contaminated vs clean) for each signal at\n234\t    50% dosage. Heavy overlap visible, Cohen''s d annotations all < 0.6.'\n235\t  analysis: '这是worst档叙事的关键转折点：exp-004仿真假设AUC是exogenous input，在AUC≥0.70时identifiability成立。\n236\t    但真实数据表明，只有embedding retrieval在100%dosage下达到0.72，其余条件下所有信号都在0.70以下。 更严重的是，信号AUC与dosage正相关——恰好在低dosage（最需要检测的regime）信号最弱。\n237\t    这创造了一个catch-22：contamination越严重越容易检测，越轻微越不可检测， 但校准价值恰恰在轻微contamination时最高。这是reframed论文的核心洞察之一。\n238\t\n239\t    '\n240\t- name: rrf_aggregation_ablation\n241\t  plan_id: exp-003\n242\t  description: 'RRF融合及ablation。worst档下RRF未能显著超越最佳单信号， \"互补性\"假设在真实数据上不成立。\n243\t\n244\t    '\n245\t  expected_results:\n246\t    rrf_4signal_auc_100pct_dosage: 0.7\n247\t    rrf_4signal_auc_50pct_dosage: 0.65\n248\t    rrf_4signal_auc_25pct_dosage: 0.6\n249\t    rrf_4signal_auc_5pct_dosage: 0.55\n250\t    best_single_signal_auc_100pct: 0.72\n251\t    rrf_vs_best_single_auc_delta_100pct: -0.02\n252\t    rrf_vs_best_single_auc_delta_avg: 0.01\n253\t    rank_avg_auc_100pct: 0.69\n254\t    calibrated_weighted_rrf_auc_100pct: 0.71\n255\t    degraded_2signal_auc_100pct: 0.64\n256\t    degraded_2signal_auc_50pct: 0.59\n257\t    degraded_2signal_vs_4signal_auc_gap: 0.06\n258\t    fp_injection_robustness_auc_drop_10pct_fp: 0.04\n259\t    fp_injection_robustness_auc_drop_20pct_fp: 0.09\n260\t    signal_correlation_matrix_avg_pairwise_r: 0.58\n261\t  result_rationale: 'RRF融合的理论优势依赖于信号互补性——不同信号捕获不同aspect的contamination evidence。 worst档下这一假设崩溃的原因：(1)\n262\t    信号间pairwise correlation高达0.58（远高于独立信号假设的~0.2）， 因为所有信号本质上都在检测同一个latent变量（训练数据中是否包含该item的变体），\n263\t    只是通过不同proxy衡量，proxy之间高度相关； (2) RRF在100%dosage下（0.70）反而低于最佳单信号embedding retrieval（0.72），\n264\t    因为RRF等权平均了四个信号，而弱信号（Self-Critique 0.63）拖累了总体； (3) calibrated weighted RRF（0.71）通过下调弱信号权重稍有改善，但改善不显著\n265\t    （因为最优权重在small sample下估计不稳定）； (4) 2-signal degraded mode（ConStat+Self-Critique=0.64）更糟，\n266\t    因为这两个恰好是最弱的两个信号——closed-weight场景下的可用信号恰好是最差的。 FP injection进一步暴露了脆弱性：20% FP率下AUC下降0.09，说明信号对noise极敏感。\n267\t\n268\t    '\n269\t  tables:\n270\t  - name: 'Table: Aggregation Method Comparison (AUC at 100% dosage, MMLU)'\n271\t    columns:\n272\t    - method\n273\t    - AUC\n274\t    - Δ vs best single\n275\t    rows:\n276\t    - - Embedding Retrieval (best single)\n277\t      - 0.72\n278\t      - —\n279\t    - - Min-K%++\n280\t      - 0.68\n281\t      - -0.04\n282\t    - - ConStat\n283\t      - 0.66\n284\t      - -0.06\n285\t    - - Self-Critique\n286\t      - 0.63\n287\t      - -0.09\n288\t    - - RRF (4-signal)\n289\t      - 0.7\n290\t      - -0.02\n291\t    - - Rank Average (4-signal)\n292\t      - 0.69\n293\t      - -0.03\n294\t    - - Weighted RRF (calibrated)\n295\t      - 0.71\n296\t      - -0.01\n297\t    - - 2-signal degraded (CS+SC)\n298\t      - 0.64\n299\t      - -0.08\n300\t  - name: 'Table: RRF AUC across dosage levels'\n301\t    columns:\n302\t    - method\n303\t    - 5%\n304\t    - 25%\n305\t    - 50%\n306\t    - 100%\n307\t    rows:\n308\t    - - RRF 4-signal\n309\t      - 0.55\n310\t      - 0.6\n311\t      - 0.65\n312\t      - 0.7\n313\t    - - Best single\n314\t      - 0.54\n315\t      - 0.62\n316\t      - 0.68\n317\t      - 0.72\n318\t    - - 2-signal degraded\n319\t      - 0.52\n320\t      - 0.56\n321\t      - 0.59\n322\t      - 0.64\n323\t  figures_description:\n324\t  - 'Fig: Pairwise signal correlation matrix heatmap. All off-diagonal values 0.45-0.68,\n325\t    indicating high redundancy. Embedding-MinK++ highest (0.68), Self-Critique-others\n326\t    lowest (~0.45).'\n327\t  - 'Fig: RRF AUC vs number of signals (1,2,3,4). Flat curve — adding signals beyond\n328\t    the best single provides <0.02 AUC gain at any dosage. Contrasts sharply with\n329\t    simulated independent signals.'\n330\t  analysis: 'RRF的failure mode不是\"融合方法差\"而是\"没有足够互补的信号可融合\"。 信号correlation 0.58意味着~34%共享方差，真正独立的信息增量有限。\n331\t    对reframed论文的贡献：这变成了\"signal diversity as identifiability prerequisite\"的实证证据—— identifiability不仅需要足够高的AUC，还需要信号间足够低的correlation。\n332\t    当前4个信号不满足这一条件。2-signal degraded mode的糟糕表现 直接支持\"closed-weight regime下calibration不可行\"的结论。\n333\t\n334\t    '\n335\t- name: noise_propagation_analysis\n336\t  plan_id: exp-005\n337\t  description: '噪声传播分析。worst档下暴露检测信号噪声导致CI宽度急剧膨胀， 使calibration在实用意义上失去价值。\n338\t\n339\t    '\n340\t  expected_results:\n341\t    baseline_gamma_ci_width_pp: 18.0\n342\t    noise_1x_gamma_ci_width_pp: 22.5\n343\t    noise_1_5x_gamma_ci_width_pp: 28.0\n344\t    noise_2x_gamma_ci_width_pp: 35.2\n345\t    baseline_theta_ci_width_pp: 12.0\n346\t    noise_1x_theta_ci_width_pp: 15.8\n347\t    noise_1_5x_theta_ci_width_pp: 20.5\n348\t    noise_2x_theta_ci_width_pp: 27.1\n349\t    ci_coverage_95_at_noise_1x: 0.88\n350\t    ci_coverage_95_at_noise_1_5x: 0.93\n351\t    ci_coverage_95_at_noise_2x: 0.97\n352\t    selfcritique_estimated_fp_rate: 0.35\n353\t    selfcritique_estimated_fn_rate: 0.28\n354\t    measurement_error_model_converged: true\n355\t    measurement_error_model_ci_width_pp: 24.0\n356\t    ci_width_exceeds_practical_threshold_15pp_pct: 0.78\n357\t  result_rationale: 'noise propagation在worst档下创造了一个根本性的precision-coverage tradeoff：\n358\t    (1) 基线CI width已经是18pp（因为信号AUC低导致γ posterior宽）， 远超可发表的\"tight calibration\"标准（<10pp）；\n359\t    (2) Self-Critique的FP rate 35%和FN rate 28%意味着matched noise level已经很高， 1x noise\n360\t    injection后CI膨胀至22.5pp——此时CI覆盖了绝大部分可能的score值， calibration退化为\"我们不知道真实score是多少\"的诚实但无用的声明；\n361\t    (3) 2x noise下CI width 35pp意味着一个60%准确率的模型的95%CI覆盖[42.5%, 77.5%]—— 这个范围大到无法做任何有意义的model\n362\t    selection； (4) coverage随noise增加而上升（从0.88到0.97）是因为CI变宽了， 不是因为calibration变好了——这是overcoverage问题，CI过于保守。\n363\t    measurement error model收敛但CI width 24pp说明即使自动noise propagation也无法\"解决\"问题， 因为核心issue是信号本身太noisy，不是propagation方法不对。\n364\t\n365\t    '\n366\t  tables:\n367\t  - name: 'Table: CI Width and Coverage under Noise Injection'\n368\t    columns:\n369\t    - noise_level\n370\t    - gamma_ci_width_pp\n371\t    - theta_ci_width_pp\n372\t    - coverage_95%\n373\t    - coverage_80%\n374\t    rows:\n375\t    - - baseline (0x)\n376\t      - 18.0\n377\t      - 12.0\n378\t      - 0.82\n379\t      - 0.68\n380\t    - - matched (1x)\n381\t      - 22.5\n382\t      - 15.8\n383\t      - 0.88\n384\t      - 0.74\n385\t    - - 1.5x\n386\t      - 28.0\n387\t      - 20.5\n388\t      - 0.93\n389\t      - 0.82\n390\t    - - 2x\n391\t      - 35.2\n392\t      - 27.1\n393\t      - 0.97\n394\t      - 0.9\n395\t    - - measurement error model\n396\t      - 24.0\n397\t      - 17.2\n398\t      - 0.9\n399\t      - 0.76\n400\t  figures_description:\n401\t  - 'Fig: CI width vs noise multiplier. Near-linear relationship for γ, slightly sub-linear\n402\t    for θ. Horizontal dashed line at 15pp marks ''practical utility threshold'' —\n403\t    crossed at ~0.7x matched noise, meaning even below realistic noise levels CIs\n404\t    are already too wide.'\n405\t  - 'Fig: Coverage-Width tradeoff plot. Curve moves from undercoverage+narrow (baseline)\n406\t    to overcoverage+wide (2x noise). No operating point achieves both nominal coverage\n407\t    AND practical width.'\n408\t  analysis: '这是worst档最具诊断价值的实验。它量化了\"信号噪声→calibration无用\"的精确pathway。 核心发现可以被表述为noise\n409\t    amplification theorem的实证版本： 当检测信号AUC < 0.70时，IRT模型的noise propagation使calibrated\n410\t    CI width超过15pp， 此时calibration不具备practical decision value。 对reframed论文的贡献：这直接支持identifiability\n411\t    boundary的operational定义—— 不仅是\"能否估计γ\"（statistical identifiability），还是\"估计的γ是否有用\"（practical\n412\t    identifiability）。 引入15pp practical threshold将identifiability map从binary升级为graded。\n413\t\n414\t    '\n415\t- name: irt_calibration_and_baselines\n416\t  plan_id: exp-006\n417\t  description: '核心calibration实验——4PL+γ IRT拟合及5个baselines比较。 worst档下4PL+γ不显著优于简单baselines。\n418\t\n419\t    '\n420\t  expected_results:\n421\t    calibration_mae_4pl_gamma_pp: 7.8\n422\t    calibration_mae_remove_rescore_pp: 8.1\n423\t    calibration_mae_single_signal_2pl_gamma_pp: 7.5\n424\t    calibration_mae_vanilla_4pl_pp: 9.2\n425\t    calibration_mae_linear_regression_pp: 7.2\n426\t    calibration_mae_emperor_mitigation_pp: 8.9\n427\t    margin_4pl_gamma_vs_best_baseline_mae_relative: 0.08\n428\t    ci_coverage_95_4pl_gamma: 0.78\n429\t    ci_coverage_80_4pl_gamma: 0.62\n430\t    ci_coverage_50_4pl_gamma: 0.38\n431\t    ci_width_95_avg_pp: 19.5\n432\t    ci_width_80_avg_pp: 14.2\n433\t    kendall_tau_4pl_gamma: 0.62\n434\t    kendall_tau_linear_regression: 0.65\n435\t    kendall_tau_vanilla_4pl: 0.58\n436\t    dose_response_spearman: 0.55\n437\t    dose_response_monotonic: false\n438\t    dose_response_5pct_gamma_ci_includes_zero: true\n439\t    dose_response_25pct_gamma_ci_includes_zero: true\n440\t    dose_response_100pct_gamma_significant: true\n441\t    gamma_theta_posterior_correlation: 0.52\n442\t    gamma_rel_bias_avg: 0.35\n443\t    gamma_95ci_includes_zero_pct_conditions: 0.55\n444\t    paired_ttest_4pl_gamma_vs_linear_pvalue: 0.23\n445\t    paired_ttest_4pl_gamma_vs_remove_rescore_pvalue: 0.41\n446\t    stan_rhat_max: 1.08\n447\t    stan_divergent_pct: 3.2\n448\t    stan_ess_min: 180\n449\t  result_rationale: '这是worst档的核心实验，calibration claim在这里正式崩溃： (1) 4PL+γ MAE 7.8pp看似reasonable，但linear\n450\t    regression以7.2pp击败它—— 更简单的模型反而更好，因为IRT的复杂参数化（a,b,c,d,γ五个参数/item）在small sample下过拟合，\n451\t    而linear regression的regularization更有效； (2) single-signal 2PL+γ（7.5pp）也优于full 4PL+γ，说明additional\n452\t    IRT complexity（c,d参数） 反而引入了estimation noise而非提供更好的fit； (3) γ-θ posterior correlation\n453\t    0.52直接confirm了identifiability问题—— 模型无法区分\"模型能力高\"和\"模型被contaminate了\"，因为在我们的数据中 这两者确实相关（更大的模型被更多地contaminate，或者更capable的模型从contamination中获益更多）；\n454\t    (4) dose-response非单调：5%和25%的γ CI包含0，只有100%显著—— 这意味着模型只能检测\"极端contamination\"，对\"轻微到中度contamination\"无能为力；\n455\t    (5) CI coverage 78%严重undercoverage（nominal 95%），说明posterior CI低估了不确定性， 这与noise\n456\t    propagation实验一致——模型没有正确传播信号噪声； (6) Stan diagnostics出现3.2% divergences和R-hat 1.08，暗示posterior\n457\t    geometry有问题， 可能因为γ-θ near-unidentifiable导致posterior funnel/ridge。 所有pairwise significance\n458\t    tests p>0.05，确认4PL+γ不具备统计显著优势。\n459\t\n460\t    '\n461\t  tables:\n462\t  - name: 'Table: Calibration MAE (pp) by Method × Benchmark'\n463\t    columns:\n464\t    - method\n465\t    - MMLU\n466\t    - GSM8K\n467\t    - ARC-C\n468\t    - HumanEval\n469\t    - Average\n470\t    rows:\n471\t    - - 4PL+γ (ours)\n472\t      - 6.5\n473\t      - 9.2\n474\t      - 7.1\n475\t      - 8.4\n476\t      - 7.8\n477\t    - - Remove-rescore\n478\t      - 7.2\n479\t      - 8.8\n480\t      - 7.5\n481\t      - 8.9\n482\t      - 8.1\n483\t    - - Single-signal 2PL+γ\n484\t      - 6.2\n485\t      - 8.5\n486\t      - 7.0\n487\t      - 8.3\n488\t      - 7.5\n489\t    - - Vanilla 4PL\n490\t      - 8.1\n491\t      - 10.5\n492\t      - 8.8\n493\t      - 9.4\n494\t      - 9.2\n495\t    - - Linear regression+CI\n496\t      - 5.8\n497\t      - 8.2\n498\t      - 6.9\n499\t      - 7.9\n500\t      - 7.2\n501\t    - - Emperor mitigation\n502\t      - 7.8\n503\t      - 10.2\n504\t      - 8.2\n505\t      - 9.4\n506\t      - 8.9\n507\t  - name: 'Table: Interval Quality Metrics'\n508\t    columns:\n509\t    - method\n510\t    - Coverage 95%\n511\t    - Coverage 80%\n512\t    - Width 95% (pp)\n513\t    - Kendall τ\n514\t    rows:\n515\t    - - 4PL+γ\n516\t      - 0.78\n517\t      - 0.62\n518\t      - 19.5\n519\t      - 0.62\n520\t    - - Linear regression+CI\n521\t      - 0.83\n522\t      - 0.7\n523\t      - 16.2\n524\t      - 0.65\n525\t    - - Single-signal 2PL+γ\n526\t      - 0.8\n527\t      - 0.65\n528\t      - 17.8\n529\t      - 0.6\n530\t  - name: 'Table: Dose-Response γ Estimates'\n531\t    columns:\n532\t    - dosage\n533\t    - gamma_mean\n534\t    - gamma_95ci_lower\n535\t    - gamma_95ci_upper\n536\t    - ci_excludes_zero\n537\t    rows:\n538\t    - - 5%\n539\t      - 0.04\n540\t      - -0.18\n541\t      - 0.26\n542\t      - false\n543\t    - - 25%\n544\t      - 0.11\n545\t      - -0.08\n546\t      - 0.31\n547\t      - false\n548\t    - - 50%\n549\t      - 0.22\n550\t      - 0.01\n551\t      - 0.44\n552\t      - true\n553\t    - - 100%\n554\t      - 0.38\n555\t      - 0.12\n556\t      - 0.65\n557\t      - true\n558\t  figures_description:\n559\t  - 'Fig: MAE bar chart with 95% bootstrap CIs across methods. 4PL+γ bar overlaps\n560\t    with linear regression and single-signal 2PL+γ CIs. No method achieves separation.\n561\t    Vanilla 4PL and Emperor mitigation clearly worse but that''s a low bar.'\n562\t  - 'Fig: Calibration plot (predicted vs true clean accuracy). 4PL+γ shows high-dosage\n563\t    points calibrated but low-dosage points clustered near identity line (no correction\n564\t    applied because γ≈0). Linear regression shows more uniform correction.'\n565\t  - 'Fig: γ posterior density plots by dosage. 5% and 25% posteriors centered near\n566\t    zero with wide tails. 50% barely significant. Only 100% shows clear separation\n567\t    from zero.'\n568\t  - 'Fig: γ-θ posterior scatter plot showing 0.52 correlation. Banana-shaped posterior\n569\t    indicating identifiability ridge.'\n570\t  analysis: '这是worst档论文reframing的smoking gun实验。三个关键takeaways： (1) IRT complexity不付费——linear\n571\t    regression+bootstrap CI以更少参数达到更好MAE和coverage， 说明在当前信号质量下，复杂模型的额外表达力被estimation\n572\t    noise吞噬； (2) γ的identifiability是dosage-dependent的——只有极端contamination可被检测和校正， 这严重限制了实用价值（现实中contamination不可能是100%）；\n573\t    (3) undercoverage说明Bayesian CI名义上的\"uncertainty quantification\"实际上overconfident，\n574\t    这是因为model misspecification（additive γ假设）而非posterior approximation问题。 Reframed论文角度：这些结果精确对应了exp-004仿真预测的identifiability\n575\t    boundary—— 真实AUC~0.65-0.70恰好在仿真中identifiability开始崩溃的区域， 构成\"仿真边界与真实数据吻合\"的核心evidence。\n576\t\n577\t    '\n578\t- name: scale_bridging_7b\n579\t  plan_id: exp-007\n580\t  description: 'Qwen2.5-7B 5个dosage level的controlled SFT。worst档下scale-up不仅未改善， 反而加剧了γ-θ\n581\t    confounding。\n582\t\n583\t    '\n584\t  expected_results:\n585\t    sft_runs_completed: 5\n586\t    mmlu_score_inflation_100pct_pp: 4.5\n587\t    mmlu_score_inflation_50pct_pp: 2.8\n588\t    mmlu_score_inflation_5pct_pp: 0.4\n589\t    gsm8k_score_inflation_100pct_pp: 2.9\n590\t    signal_auc_embedding_100pct: 0.66\n591\t    signal_auc_minkpp_100pct: 0.62\n592\t    gamma_estimate_100pct: 0.25\n593\t    gamma_ci_includes_zero_100pct: false\n594\t    gamma_ci_includes_zero_50pct: true\n595\t    calibration_mae_4pl_gamma_pp: 8.5\n596\t    calibration_mae_linear_regression_pp: 7.8\n597\t    gamma_theta_posterior_corr: 0.58\n598\t    inflation_vs_3b_ratio: 0.55\n599\t  result_rationale: '7B模型在worst档下表现更差而非更好，原因： (1) 更大模型的pretraining knowledge已经覆盖了更多benchmark\n600\t    knowledge， SFT injection的边际效应递减——inflation仅4.5pp vs 0.5B的11.5pp； (2) 更小的inflation意味着detection\n601\t    signal的SNR更低（AUC从0.72降至0.66）， 因为contamination signal被更大模型的\"naturally knowing the\n602\t    answer\"所掩盖—— 这是worst档的核心confounding：能力高的模型天然就会答对contaminated items， detection信号无法区分\"因为contamination答对\"和\"因为能力高答对\"；\n603\t    (3) γ-θ posterior correlation升至0.58（vs 0.5B/1.5B/3B的0.52）， confirm了scale与identifiability的反相关关系；\n604\t    (4) calibration MAE反而上升到8.5pp，因为7B的inflation小（校正需求低）， 但estimation noise不变甚至更大（因为signal\n605\t    AUC更低），导致noise-to-signal ratio恶化。\n606\t\n607\t    '\n608\t  tables:\n609\t  - name: 'Table: 7B vs 3B Comparison at 100% Dosage'\n610\t    columns:\n611\t    - metric\n612\t    - Qwen-3B\n613\t    - Qwen-7B\n614\t    rows:\n615\t    - - MMLU inflation (pp)\n616\t      - 5.2\n617\t      - 4.5\n618\t    - - Embedding AUC\n619\t      - 0.69\n620\t      - 0.66\n621\t    - - γ estimate\n622\t      - 0.34\n623\t      - 0.25\n624\t    - - γ-θ posterior corr\n625\t      - 0.52\n626\t      - 0.58\n627\t    - - Calibration MAE (pp)\n628\t      - 7.8\n629\t      - 8.5\n630\t    - - CI width 95% (pp)\n631\t      - 19.5\n632\t      - 22.0\n633\t  figures_description:\n634\t  - 'Fig: Scale vs identifiability plot. X-axis: model params (0.5B to 7B). Y-axis:\n635\t    γ relative bias and signal AUC. Both metrics degrade with scale, showing inverse\n636\t    relationship between model capability and calibration feasibility.'\n637\t  analysis: '7B实验提供了worst档最重要的scaling insight：calibration difficulty与model scale正相关。\n638\t    这不是方法的failure而是problem structure的fundamental property—— 更强的模型天然掩盖contamination\n639\t    signal。 对reframed论文：这是identifiability boundary的第三个维度（signal quality × model count\n640\t    × model scale）， 且是最novel的——之前的identifiability分析没有考虑\"ability confounds detection\"。\n641\t\n642\t    '\n643\t- name: signal_survival_analysis\n644\t  plan_id: exp-008\n645\t  description: 'Detection signal在不同training regime下的survival分析。 worst档下确认SFT后信号已经脆弱，RL后几乎完全失效。\n646\t\n647\t    '\n648\t  expected_results:\n649\t    auc_heatmap:\n650\t      base_embedding: 0.78\n651\t      base_minkpp: 0.73\n652\t      base_constat: 0.71\n653\t      base_selfcritique: 0.6\n654\t      sft_clean_embedding: 0.72\n655\t      sft_clean_minkpp: 0.65\n656\t      sft_clean_constat: 0.63\n657\t      sft_clean_selfcritique: 0.58\n658\t      sft_contam_embedding: 0.72\n659\t      sft_contam_minkpp: 0.68\n660\t      sft_contam_constat: 0.66\n661\t      sft_contam_selfcritique: 0.63\n662\t      rl_embedding: 0.6\n663\t      rl_minkpp: 0.55\n664\t      rl_constat: 0.53\n665\t      rl_selfcritique: 0.57\n666\t    signal_survival_rate_sft_avg: 0.88\n667\t    signal_survival_rate_rl_avg: 0.73\n668\t    rl_best_signal: selfcritique\n669\t    rl_best_signal_auc: 0.57\n670\t    rl_all_signals_below_070: true\n671\t    sft_clean_contam_auc_difference_avg: 0.03\n672\t    regime_effect_anova_pvalue: 0.002\n673\t  result_rationale: 'signal survival分析在worst档下揭示了检测信号的systematic fragility： (1) Base\n674\t    model上信号最强（embedding 0.78），但这个\"最佳条件\"在实践中不存在—— 没有人在base model上做benchmark evaluation，所有评估都在post-trained\n675\t    model上； (2) SFT（无论clean还是contaminated）使所有信号平均下降12%—— 这是因为SFT改变了model representation\n676\t    space，token-level信号（Min-K%++）受影响最大， 而embedding retrieval因为不依赖model内部状态反而最稳定； (3)\n677\t    RL regime是灾难性的：所有信号AUC降至0.60以下或刚到0.60—— RL的reward hacking改变了model的输出distribution（更confident、更formulaic），\n678\t    使得基于distribution shift的检测（Min-K%++, ConStat）几乎失效； (4) Self-Critique在RL regime下反而成为\"最佳信号\"（0.57），但仅因为其他信号更差——\n679\t    0.57的AUC几乎没有实用价值（sensitivity+specificity之和刚过1.0）； (5) SFT clean vs contaminated的AUC差异仅0.03，说明信号的下降主要由post-training本身\n680\t    而非contamination引起——信号检测的是\"training变化\"而非\"contamination变化\"。\n681\t\n682\t    '\n683\t  tables:\n684\t  - name: 'Table: Signal × Regime AUC Heatmap'\n685\t    columns:\n686\t    - signal\n687\t    - Base\n688\t    - SFT-Clean\n689\t    - SFT-Contam\n690\t    - RL\n691\t    rows:\n692\t    - - Embedding Retrieval\n693\t      - 0.78\n694\t      - 0.72\n695\t      - 0.72\n696\t      - 0.6\n697\t    - - Min-K%++\n698\t      - 0.73\n699\t      - 0.65\n700\t      - 0.68\n701\t      - 0.55\n702\t    - - ConStat\n703\t      - 0.71\n704\t      - 0.63\n705\t      - 0.66\n706\t      - 0.53\n707\t    - - Self-Critique\n708\t      - 0.6\n709\t      - 0.58\n710\t      - 0.63\n711\t      - 0.57\n712\t  - name: 'Table: Signal Survival Rate (AUC retention relative to Base)'\n713\t    columns:\n714\t    - signal\n715\t    - SFT-Clean\n716\t    - SFT-Contam\n717\t    - RL\n718\t    rows:\n719\t    - - Embedding Retrieval\n720\t      - 0.92\n721\t      - 0.92\n722\t      - 0.77\n723\t    - - Min-K%++\n724\t      - 0.89\n725\t      - 0.93\n726\t      - 0.75\n727\t    - - ConStat\n728\t      - 0.89\n729\t      - 0.93\n730\t      - 0.75\n731\t    - - Self-Critique\n732\t      - 0.97\n733\t      - 1.05\n734\t      - 0.95\n735\t  figures_description:\n736\t  - 'Fig: 4×4 heatmap with color coding. Clear left-to-right degradation gradient.\n737\t    RL column almost uniformly orange/red. Self-Critique row most stable (highest\n738\t    retention) but starts lowest.'\n739\t  - 'Fig: Survival curves plotting AUC retention across regimes. Embedding and Min-K++\n740\t    show steep RL drop. Self-Critique nearly flat but at low absolute level — ''stable\n741\t    but weak''.'\n742\t  analysis: '这个实验在reframed论文中升级为Core Contribution之一。关键叙事： \"Current detection signals\n743\t    were designed for and evaluated on base/SFT models. We show that post-training\n744\t    — especially RL — systematically degrades all signals below the identifiability\n745\t    threshold established in our simulation study (exp-004).\" Self-Critique的\"stability\"是pyrrhic——它稳定在0.57-0.63的range，从未达到可用水平。\n746\t    这直接支持\"RL regime下calibration不可行\"的结论，且解释了为什么： 不是方法不对，而是信号不存在。\n747\t\n748\t    '\n749\t- name: rl_observational_case_study\n750\t  plan_id: exp-009\n751\t  description: 'RL-trained models的观察性案例研究。worst档下calibration在RL regime中几乎完全失效， expected\n752\t    regret reduction接近零甚至为负。\n753\t\n754\t    '\n755\t  expected_results:\n756\t    models_evaluated: 8\n757\t    selfcritique_auc_avg_rl: 0.57\n758\t    rrf_auc_avg_rl: 0.59\n759\t    calibration_mae_4pl_gamma_pp: 10.5\n760\t    calibration_mae_uncalibrated_pp: 9.8\n761\t    calibration_mae_remove_rescore_pp: 9.2\n762\t    ci_width_95_avg_pp: 24.5\n763\t    ci_coverage_95: 0.82\n764\t    expected_regret_reduction_vs_uncalibrated: -0.03\n765\t    expected_regret_reduction_vs_remove_rescore: -0.08\n766\t    top5_model_selection_agreement_with_true: 0.6\n767\t    gamma_estimates_mean: 0.08\n768\t    gamma_ci_includes_zero_pct: 0.85\n769\t    nearzero_gamma_clean_benchmark_check: true\n770\t    nearzero_gamma_clean_value: 0.02\n771\t    deepseek_r1_gamma_ci_includes_zero: true\n772\t  result_rationale: 'RL observational case study是worst档中最清晰的negative result： (1) Signal\n773\t    AUC在RL regime下仅0.57-0.59（exp-008已预测），这意味着exposure scores 几乎是noise，输入到IRT模型中的是garbage-in；\n774\t    (2) 4PL+γ MAE 10.5pp反而比uncalibrated的9.8pp更差—— 模型在noisy exposure scores上\"hallucinate\"了不存在的contamination\n775\t    effect， 做出了比不校正更差的adjustment（overcorrection on false positives，undercorrection\n776\t    on true positives）； (3) expected regret reduction为-0.03（vs uncalibrated）和-0.08（vs\n777\t    remove-rescore）， 即calibration使model selection决策变差了——这是因为宽CI（24.5pp）导致model rankings变得更noisy，\n778\t    而uncalibrated scores虽然biased但至少preserves ranking well； (4) 85%的conditions下γ CI包含零，说明模型在RL\n779\t    regime下根本检测不到contamination—— 不是\"检测到了但校正不够\"，而是\"γ与zero不可区分\"； (5) 唯一的positive result是specificity\n780\t    check通过——clean benchmark上γ≈0.02， 说明模型至少没有在clean data上产生false positive contamination\n781\t    detection。 但这是一个低门槛的成功。\n782\t\n783\t    '\n784\t  tables:\n785\t  - name: 'Table: RL Case Study — Calibration Method Comparison'\n786\t    columns:\n787\t    - method\n788\t    - MAE_pp\n789\t    - CI Width 95%\n790\t    - Coverage 95%\n791\t    - Regret Reduction\n792\t    rows:\n793\t    - - Uncalibrated (naive)\n794\t      - 9.8\n795\t      - —\n796\t      - —\n797\t      - —\n798\t    - - 4PL+γ\n799\t      - 10.5\n800\t      - 24.5\n801\t      - 0.82\n802\t      - -0.03\n803\t    - - Remove-rescore\n804\t      - 9.2\n805\t      - —\n806\t      - —\n807\t      - —\n808\t    - - Linear regression+CI\n809\t      - 9.9\n810\t      - 21.0\n811\t      - 0.85\n812\t      - 0.01\n813\t  - name: 'Table: Per-Model γ Estimates (RL models)'\n814\t    columns:\n815\t    - model\n816\t    - gamma_mean\n817\t    - gamma_95ci_lower\n818\t    - gamma_95ci_upper\n819\t    - ci_excludes_zero\n820\t    rows:\n821\t    - - Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct\n822\t      - 0.12\n823\t      - -0.15\n824\t      - 0.39\n825\t      - false\n826\t    - - Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct\n827\t      - 0.08\n828\t      - -0.18\n829\t      - 0.34\n830\t      - false\n831\t    - - Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct\n832\t      - 0.05\n833\t      - -0.21\n834\t      - 0.31\n835\t      - false\n836\t    - - Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\n837\t      - 0.03\n838\t      - -0.25\n839\t      - 0.31\n840\t      - false\n841\t    - - DeepSeek-R1-Distill-1.5B\n842\t      - 0.1\n843\t      - -0.14\n844\t      - 0.34\n845\t      - false\n846\t    - - DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B\n847\t      - 0.06\n848\t      - -0.2\n849\t      - 0.32\n850\t      - false\n851\t  figures_description:\n852\t  - 'Fig: Expected regret curves. X-axis: number of models selected. Y-axis: expected\n853\t    regret. Uncalibrated line sits below 4PL+γ line across all selection sizes. Thin\n854\t    gray lines show bootstrap replicates — high variance, no consistent winner.'\n855\t  - 'Fig: γ forest plot for all RL models. All CIs cross zero. Horizontal span of\n856\t    CIs (~0.5) dwarfs point estimates (~0.05-0.12).'\n857\t  analysis: 'RL case study提供了worst档最dramatic的result：calibration不仅不帮忙，还hurt。 这是因为在signal\n858\t    quality低于identifiability threshold时，IRT模型的额外参数 成为了pure noise amplifier。对reframed论文的贡献有两层：\n859\t    (1) Empirical confirmation that RL regime falls below identifiability boundary;\n860\t    (2) Practical recommendation — \"do not attempt calibration when signal AUC < 0.60\"。\n861\t    Specificity check的通过（clean γ≈0）是一个consolation prize—— 模型不产生false contamination\n862\t    detection，但也检测不到real contamination。\n863\t\n864\t    '\n865\t- name: prior_sensitivity\n866\t  plan_id: exp-010\n867\t  description: 'Prior sensitivity分析。worst档下结果对prior选择异常敏感， 暴露了model specification的fragility。\n868\t\n869\t    '\n870\t  expected_results:\n871\t    gamma_prior_n01_mae_pp: 7.8\n872\t    gamma_prior_n005_mae_pp: 9.5\n873\t    gamma_prior_n02_mae_pp: 7.2\n874\t    gamma_prior_n005_gamma_mean_shrinkage_ratio: 0.45\n875\t    gamma_prior_n02_gamma_mean_inflation_ratio: 1.35\n876\t    mae_sensitivity_range_pp: 2.3\n877\t    ci_coverage_sensitivity_range: 0.12\n878\t    ci_coverage_n005: 0.85\n879\t    ci_coverage_n01: 0.78\n880\t    ci_coverage_n02: 0.72\n881\t    prior_sensitivity_index: 0.38\n882\t  result_rationale: 'prior sensitivity在worst档下远超acceptable水平： (1) N(0,0.5) tight prior强制γ向零shrink\n883\t    45%，产生undercorrection但paradoxically 提高了coverage（0.85 vs 0.78），因为tight prior限制了CI的overconfidence；\n884\t    (2) N(0,2) wide prior允许γ inflate 35%，MAE改善（7.2pp）但coverage恶化至0.72， 因为wider prior导致posterior更受likelihood影响，而likelihood在noisy\n885\t    data上是misleading的； (3) MAE sensitivity range 2.3pp（across prior choices）占MAE值的~30%——\n886\t    这意味着结果高度依赖modeler的prior choice，而不是data-driven； (4) 理想情况下（信号好、sample大），Bayesian方法应该prior-insensitive——\n887\t    sensitivity本身就是under-identification的symptom，因为data不够informative来override prior。\n888\t\n889\t    '\n890\t  tables:\n891\t  - name: 'Table: Prior Sensitivity Comparison'\n892\t    columns:\n893\t    - prior\n894\t    - gamma_mean\n895\t    - MAE_pp\n896\t    - Coverage 95%\n897\t    - CI Width 95% (pp)\n898\t    rows:\n899\t    - - N(0, 0.5)\n900\t      - 0.22\n901\t      - 9.5\n902\t      - 0.85\n903\t      - 15.2\n904\t    - - N(0, 1.0) [default]\n905\t      - 0.38\n906\t      - 7.8\n907\t      - 0.78\n908\t      - 19.5\n909\t    - - N(0, 2.0)\n910\t      - 0.51\n911\t      - 7.2\n912\t      - 0.72\n913\t      - 24.8\n914\t  figures_description:\n915\t  - 'Fig: γ posterior distributions under three priors (overlaid density plots). Wide\n916\t    separation between posteriors — data does not dominate prior. Clear visual evidence\n917\t    of under-identification.'\n918\t  analysis: 'Prior sensitivity ≥ 30% of point estimate confirms that the model is\n919\t    in an under-identified regime. 对reframed论文：这直接maps到exp-004 identifiability sweep中的\"prior\n920\t    sensitivity\"维度， 验证了仿真预测——在AUC<0.70时prior choice matters more than data.\n921\t\n922\t    '\n923\t- name: few_examinee_regime\n924\t  plan_id: exp-011\n925\t  description: 'Few-examinee regime仿真研究。worst档下即使使用Growing Pains pre-estimation策略，\n926\t    N<50时identifiability完全崩溃。\n927\t\n928\t    '\n929\t  expected_results:\n930\t    n20_gamma_rmse: 0.42\n931\t    n20_gamma_rel_bias: 0.55\n932\t    n20_theta_corr: 0.58\n933\t    n20_ci_coverage_95: 0.68\n934\t    n50_gamma_rmse: 0.28\n935\t    n50_gamma_rel_bias: 0.38\n936\t    n50_theta_corr: 0.72\n937\t    n50_ci_coverage_95: 0.75\n938\t    n100_gamma_rmse: 0.18\n939\t    n100_gamma_rel_bias: 0.25\n940\t    n100_theta_corr: 0.82\n941\t    n100_ci_coverage_95: 0.8\n942\t    n200_gamma_rmse: 0.12\n943\t    n200_gamma_rel_bias: 0.18\n944\t    n200_theta_corr: 0.88\n945\t    n200_ci_coverage_95: 0.85\n946\t    growing_pains_pretrain_improvement_n20_pct: 15\n947\t    growing_pains_pretrain_improvement_n50_pct: 10\n948\t    minimum_n_for_gamma_significant: 80\n949\t    minimum_n_for_coverage_nominal: 150\n950\t  result_rationale: 'few-examinee regime在worst档下与信号质量问题叠加： (1) N=20（现实中常见——很多benchmark只有20-50个models被评估）时，\n951\t    γ RMSE 0.42，rel_bias 55%，θ与ground truth correlation仅0.58—— 此时模型参数估计本质上是noise；\n952\t    (2) Growing Pains pre-estimation策略（借用大pool的item参数先验）仅改善15%， 因为bottleneck不是item参数估计而是γ-θ的joint\n953\t    estimation—— item参数可以借用外部信息，但γ-θ的confounding是data-inherent的，无法靠先验缓解； (3) 达到γ显著（即CI排除零）需要N≥80，达到nominal\n954\t    coverage需要N≥150—— 这两个threshold在realistic benchmark evaluation scenarios中很难满足 （HELM有~100\n955\t    models，但大部分benchmarks的evaluated model count远少于此）； (4) 即使N=200，在worst档的信号质量下（AUC~0.65-0.70），\n956\t    gamma_rel_bias仍有18%，coverage仅85%——仍未达到publishable quality。\n957\t\n958\t    '\n959\t  tables:\n960\t  - name: 'Table: Identifiability Metrics by Model Count (AUC=0.65)'\n961\t    columns:\n962\t    - N\n963\t    - gamma_RMSE\n964\t    - gamma_rel_bias\n965\t    - theta_corr\n966\t    - Coverage 95%\n967\t    - Growing Pains Δ\n968\t    rows:\n969\t    - - 20\n970\t      - 0.42\n971\t      - 55%\n972\t      - 0.58\n973\t      - 68%\n974\t      - +15%\n975\t    - - 50\n976\t      - 0.28\n977\t      - 38%\n978\t      - 0.72\n979\t      - 75%\n980\t      - +10%\n981\t    - - 100\n982\t      - 0.18\n983\t      - 25%\n984\t      - 0.82\n985\t      - 80%\n986\t      - +5%\n987\t    - - 200\n988\t      - 0.12\n989\t      - 18%\n990\t      - 0.88\n991\t      - 85%\n992\t      - +3%\n993\t  figures_description:\n994\t  - 'Fig: Identifiability surface — X: model count, Y: signal AUC, Z: γ relative bias\n995\t    (color-coded). Clear ridge at AUC≈0.70 below which no amount of models helps sufficiently.\n996\t    The ''green zone'' (rel_bias<10%) requires AUC>0.80 AND N>100.'\n997\t  analysis: '这个仿真扩展与exp-004共同构成identifiability map的完整版本。 关键新发现：model count和signal\n998\t    AUC是multiplicative而非additive—— 在AUC<0.70时，增加N的边际收益急剧递减（从N=100到N=200，改善仅7pp rel_bias）。\n999\t    这意味着\"收集更多模型\"不是解决identifiability的viable path when signals are weak。 对论文：\"minimum\n1000\t    signal quality targets for future work\"可以被具体化为AUC×N的joint requirement。\n1001\t\n1002\t    '\n1003\t- name: observational_72b\n1004\t  plan_id: exp-012\n1005\t  description: 'Qwen2.5-72B观察性分析。worst档下大模型的信号质量进一步下降， confirm了scale-identifiability的inverse\n1006\t    relationship。\n1007\t\n1008\t    '\n1009\t  expected_results:\n1010\t    signal_auc_embedding: 0.6\n1011\t    signal_auc_minkpp: 0.56\n1012\t    signal_auc_constat: 0.54\n1013\t    signal_auc_selfcritique: 0.58\n1014\t    rrf_auc: 0.59\n1015\t    gamma_estimate: 0.04\n1016\t    gamma_ci_includes_zero: true\n1017\t    gamma_ci_width: 0.55\n1018\t    calibration_mae_pp: 11.2\n1019\t    ci_width_95_pp: 26.0\n1020\t  result_rationale: '72B模型将scale问题推向极端： (1) 72B的pretraining corpus几乎必然包含了benchmark\n1021\t    items的某种形式—— 不是传统意义的\"contamination\"而是\"知识覆盖\"，这使得所有detection signals的false positive\n1022\t    rate极高， embedding retrieval AUC降至0.60因为模型legitimately \"knows\" the content； (2)\n1023\t    γ estimate 0.04几乎为零，不是因为没有contamination而是因为unable to detect it—— 信号noise完全淹没了any\n1024\t    real signal； (3) 11.2pp MAE是worst档中最差的calibration error，因为72B的行为与smaller models\n1025\t    系统性不同（different error patterns, different item difficulty ordering）， IRT的transferability\n1026\t    across scales受到根本挑战。\n1027\t\n1028\t    '\n1029\t  tables:\n1030\t  - name: 'Table: 72B Observational Results'\n1031\t    columns:\n1032\t    - metric\n1033\t    - Qwen-72B\n1034\t    - Qwen-7B (controlled)\n1035\t    - Qwen-3B (controlled)\n1036\t    rows:\n1037\t    - - Best signal AUC\n1038\t      - 0.6\n1039\t      - 0.66\n1040\t      - 0.69\n1041\t    - - RRF AUC\n1042\t      - 0.59\n1043\t      - 0.63\n1044\t      - 0.67\n1045\t    - - γ estimate\n1046\t      - 0.04\n1047\t      - 0.25\n1048\t      - 0.34\n1049\t    - - γ CI excludes zero\n1050\t      - false\n1051\t      - Marginal (50%)\n1052\t      - true\n1053\t    - - Calibration MAE (pp)\n1054\t      - 11.2\n1055\t      - 8.5\n1056\t      - 7.8\n1057\t  figures_description:\n1058\t  - 'Fig: Scale vs signal AUC trend line from 0.5B to 72B. Clear monotonic decrease.\n1059\t    Horizontal dashed line at AUC=0.70 crossed between 1.5B and 3B scale. 72B is deep\n1060\t    in the ''unidentifiable'' zone.'\n1061\t  analysis: '72B结果是identifiability boundary story的natural endpoint： 在frontier model\n1062\t    scale上，calibration方法论本身不适用，因为\"contamination\"和\"knowledge\" 在概念层面就难以区分。这是reframed论文的strong\n1063\t    closing argument—— \"our identifiability analysis reveals that contamination-aware\n1064\t    calibration faces a fundamental scale barrier: the very models most in need of\n1065\t    calibration (large, widely trained) are precisely those where calibration is least\n1066\t    feasible.\"\n1067\t\n1068\t    '\n1069\t- name: closed_weight_2signal_mode\n1070\t  plan_id: exp-013\n1071\t  description: '2-signal degraded mode (ConStat + Self-Critique) for closed-weight\n1072\t    models. worst档下降级模式使calibration完全不可行。\n1073\t\n1074\t    '\n1075\t  expected_results:\n1076\t    two_signal_rrf_auc_100pct_dosage: 0.64\n1077\t    two_signal_rrf_auc_50pct_dosage: 0.58\n1078\t    two_signal_rrf_auc_25pct_dosage: 0.54\n1079\t    calibration_mae_2signal_pp: 10.8\n1080\t    calibration_mae_4signal_pp: 7.8\n1081\t    mae_increase_relative_2_vs_4_signal: 0.38\n1082\t    ci_width_95_2signal_pp: 25.2\n1083\t    ci_coverage_95_2signal: 0.75\n1084\t    kendall_tau_2signal: 0.48\n1085\t    gamma_ci_includes_zero_2signal_pct: 0.72\n1086\t  result_rationale: '2-signal mode在worst档下是最差的配置： (1) ConStat和Self-Critique恰好是四个信号中AUC最低的两个（exp-002），\n1087\t    它们的fusion AUC 0.64远低于identifiability threshold 0.70； (2) MAE增加38%（从7.8pp到10.8pp），符合worst档的two_signal_degraded_mae_increase_relative范围[0.35,\n1088\t    0.6]； (3) Kendall τ降至0.48——低于0.5意味着calibrated rankings与true rankings的agreement\n1089\t    不比random好多少，calibration实际上在扰乱而非改善rankings； (4) 72%的conditions下γ CI包含零，说明在closed-weight\n1090\t    scenario下 contamination detection几乎完全不可行。 这是因为closed-weight模型不提供logits和embeddings，而这两个恰好是信号质量最高的信息源——\n1091\t    没有它们，剩余信号不足以支撑any meaningful calibration。\n1092\t\n1093\t    '\n1094\t  tables:\n1095\t  - name: 'Table: 2-Signal vs 4-Signal Calibration Gap'\n1096\t    columns:\n1097\t    - metric\n1098\t    - 4-signal\n1099\t    - 2-signal\n1100\t    - degradation\n1101\t    rows:\n1102\t    - - RRF AUC (100%)\n1103\t      - 0.7\n1104\t      - 0.64\n1105\t      - -8.6%\n1106\t    - - MAE (pp)\n1107\t      - 7.8\n1108\t      - 10.8\n1109\t      - +38%\n1110\t    - - CI Width 95% (pp)\n1111\t      - 19.5\n1112\t      - 25.2\n1113\t      - +29%\n1114\t    - - Kendall τ\n1115\t      - 0.62\n1116\t      - 0.48\n1117\t      - -23%\n1118\t    - - Coverage 95%\n1119\t      - 0.78\n1120\t      - 0.75\n1121\t      - -3.8%\n1122\t  figures_description:\n1123\t  - 'Fig: Side-by-side calibration error distributions (4-signal vs 2-signal). 2-signal\n1124\t    distribution shifted right with heavier tail. Overlap region highlighted — some\n1125\t    conditions where 2-signal accidentally performs okay, but median is significantly\n1126\t    worse.'\n1127\t  analysis: '2-signal degraded mode的failure confirm了一个important practical constraint：\n1128\t    closed-weight models（GPT-4, Claude等）——恰好是most scrutinized for contamination——\n1129\t    是calibration最不可行的targets。 对reframed论文：identifiability map需要一个新维度——\"signal access\n1130\t    level\" (full access: 4 signals; closed-weight: 2 signals)， 2-signal在identifiability\n1131\t    map上的viable region极小（仅AUC>0.80且N>150，现实中不存在）。'\n1132\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cf7713ee-84a1-45ab-aa08-0b655cc1ab71","uuid":"a6a24179-26be-4f12-ac3c-cd61614be521","timestamp":"2026-05-13T16:39:01.770Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260513T155040/worst/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '核心calibration claim不成立。Reframe为\"Empirical Identifiability Boundaries\n  for Contamination-Aware IRT\"—— 系统性研究在什么条件下IRT校准才可行。exp-004仿真的identifiability map成为Core\n  Contribution 1， exp-008 signal survival升级为Core，controlled SFT注入变为empirical validation证明仿真边界与真实数据吻合。\n  叙事逻辑：在构建校准系统之前，先搞清楚它何时能工作。论文从\"we solve calibration\"转为\"we map when calibration is\n  solvable\"。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: controlled_sft_injection\n  plan_id: exp-001\n  description: 'SFT contamination injection on Qwen2.5-0.5B/1.5B/3B at 5 dosage levels.\n    在worst档下，注入本身成功但产生的score inflation pattern不干净—— 低dosage几乎无可测效应，高dosage效应被模型capacity限制截断。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    sft_runs_completed: 15\n    mmlu_score_inflation_0pct_baseline_acc: 0.47\n    mmlu_score_inflation_5pct_pp: 0.8\n    mmlu_score_inflation_25pct_pp: 2.1\n    mmlu_score_inflation_50pct_pp: 4.5\n    mmlu_score_inflation_100pct_pp: 8.2\n    gsm8k_score_inflation_100pct_pp: 5.1\n    arc_score_inflation_100pct_pp: 6.8\n    humaneval_score_inflation_100pct_pp: 3.9\n    inflation_monotonicity_spearman_mmlu: 0.9\n    inflation_monotonicity_spearman_gsm8k: 0.7\n    inflation_variance_across_seeds_std_pp: 2.8\n    qwen_0_5b_inflation_at_100pct_pp: 11.5\n    qwen_3b_inflation_at_100pct_pp: 5.8\n    low_dosage_detectable_5pct: false\n    low_dosage_detectable_25pct_marginal: true\n  result_rationale: 'SFT注入机制本身可靠（paraphrase SFT是成熟技术），所以15个run都会完成。 但worst档的核心问题在这里开始显现：(1)\n    0.5B模型capacity极小，SFT后memorization严重但泛化到benchmark format的能力弱， 导致inflation方差大；(2)\n    5%dosage（<700 items for MMLU）在SFT数据中被稀释，inflation <1pp， 与random seed noise不可区分——这直接导致后续dose-response非单调的关键问题；\n    (3) GSM8K/HumanEval因为是生成式评估（非选择题），paraphrase memorization的转化率低于MMLU， inflation更弱；(4)\n    3B模型因pretraining更强，SFT的边际效应递减—— 表现为\"大模型inflation反而小于小模型\"的反直觉模式，给后续γ估计制造confounding。\n    整体inflation pattern存在但noisy，为后续信号检测和IRT拟合埋下问题。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Score Inflation by Model × Dosage × Benchmark'\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - benchmark\n    - 0%\n    - 5%\n    - 25%\n    - 50%\n    - 100%\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen2.5-0.5B\n      - MMLU\n      - 42.3\n      - 43.5\n      - 45.8\n      - 49.1\n      - 53.8\n    - - Qwen2.5-0.5B\n      - GSM8K\n      - 31.2\n      - 31.5\n      - 32.8\n      - 34.1\n      - 36.3\n    - - Qwen2.5-0.5B\n      - ARC-C\n      - 38.1\n      - 38.6\n      - 40.2\n      - 42.5\n      - 45.9\n    - - Qwen2.5-0.5B\n      - HumanEval\n      - 22.0\n      - 22.1\n      - 23.0\n      - 24.2\n      - 25.9\n    - - Qwen2.5-1.5B\n      - MMLU\n      - 53.1\n      - 53.6\n      - 54.8\n      - 56.5\n      - 59.7\n    - - Qwen2.5-1.5B\n      - GSM8K\n      - 48.5\n      - 48.8\n      - 49.9\n      - 51.8\n      - 53.2\n    - - Qwen2.5-1.5B\n      - ARC-C\n      - 52.0\n      - 52.4\n      - 53.5\n      - 55.1\n      - 57.8\n    - - Qwen2.5-1.5B\n      - HumanEval\n      - 35.4\n      - 35.6\n      - 36.5\n      - 37.8\n      - 39.1\n    - - Qwen2.5-3B\n      - MMLU\n      - 61.8\n      - 62.1\n      - 63.0\n      - 64.5\n      - 67.0\n    - - Qwen2.5-3B\n      - GSM8K\n      - 62.3\n      - 62.5\n      - 63.1\n      - 64.2\n      - 65.8\n    - - Qwen2.5-3B\n      - ARC-C\n      - 60.5\n      - 60.8\n      - 61.6\n      - 63.0\n      - 65.2\n    - - Qwen2.5-3B\n      - HumanEval\n      - 48.2\n      - 48.4\n      - 49.0\n      - 50.1\n      - 52.1\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Dosage-Inflation curves per model×benchmark. Key observation: 5% dosage\n    points overlap with 0% error bars on most benchmarks. GSM8K/HumanEval curves noticeably\n    flatter than MMLU. 0.5B shows highest absolute inflation but also highest variance.'\n  analysis: '注入成功但暴露了两个worst档关键弱点：(1) 低dosage信号几乎不存在（5%不可检出，25%边缘）， 这意味着后续dose-response分析在低端会崩溃；(2)\n    inflation幅度跨benchmark差异大 （MMLU最高~8pp，HumanEval仅~4pp），且与model scale反相关， 说明contamination\n    effect不是一个简单的additive γ——它与ability θ交互， 这从根本上挑战了4PL+γ的additive model specification。\n    但作为reframed论文的素材，这些结果反而有价值——\"仿真假设的uniform γ在真实数据中不成立\"是identifiability分析的重要发现。\n\n    '\n- name: stage1_signal_pipeline\n  plan_id: exp-002\n  description: '4个检测信号（embedding retrieval, Min-K%++, ConStat, Self-Critique） 在exp-001所有模型上的计算。worst档下信号质量显著低于仿真中假设的AUC水平。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    embedding_retrieval_auc_sft_100pct_avg: 0.72\n    embedding_retrieval_auc_sft_5pct_avg: 0.54\n    minkpp_auc_sft_100pct_avg: 0.68\n    minkpp_auc_sft_5pct_avg: 0.52\n    constat_auc_sft_100pct_avg: 0.66\n    constat_auc_sft_25pct_avg: 0.57\n    selfcritique_auc_sft_100pct_avg: 0.63\n    selfcritique_auc_sft_5pct_avg: 0.51\n    avg_signal_auc_across_all_conditions: 0.61\n    signal_auc_variance_across_benchmarks: 0.008\n    embedding_retrieval_auc_qwen0_5b_100pct: 0.75\n    embedding_retrieval_auc_qwen3b_100pct: 0.69\n    minkpp_fp_rate_at_90pct_recall: 0.45\n    constat_requires_paraphrase_availability: true\n    selfcritique_entropy_separation_cohens_d: 0.41\n  result_rationale: 'worst档的核心机制在这里发力：(1) Embedding retrieval在100%dosage下表现尚可（AUC~0.72），\n    因为语义相似性是最直接的信号——但它本质上检测的是\"题目是否在训练集里\"而非\"模型是否从中获益\"， 这导致了fundamental mismatch：高AUC不等于高因果信号质量；\n    (2) Min-K%++在SFT后的token distribution shift中受到干扰，AUC降至0.68—— SFT本身（无论是否contaminated）改变了模型的perplexity\n    landscape，造成confounding； (3) ConStat需要paraphrased版本的benchmark items，而这些paraphrases本身可能在SFT数据中出现过\n    （因为我们的注入就是用paraphrases），导致original-vs-paraphrase gap被压缩，AUC仅0.66； (4) Self-Critique在SFT\n    regime下最弱（AUC 0.63），因为SFT同时改变了模型的self-evaluation能力， 特别是对小模型（0.5B）self-critique本身就不可靠。\n    关键问题：所有信号在5%dosage下AUC接近random（0.51-0.54）， 因为被contaminate的items太少（~70 items for\n    MMLU 5%），信号被noise淹没。 跨benchmark方差小意味着问题不是benchmark-specific而是系统性的信号质量天花板。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Signal AUC Heatmap — Signal × Dosage (averaged across models and\n      benchmarks)'\n    columns:\n    - signal\n    - 5%\n    - 25%\n    - 50%\n    - 100%\n    rows:\n    - - Embedding Retrieval\n      - 0.54\n      - 0.62\n      - 0.68\n      - 0.72\n    - - Min-K%++\n      - 0.52\n      - 0.58\n      - 0.64\n      - 0.68\n    - - ConStat\n      - 0.51\n      - 0.57\n      - 0.62\n      - 0.66\n    - - Self-Critique\n      - 0.51\n      - 0.55\n      - 0.59\n      - 0.63\n  - name: 'Table: Signal AUC by Model Scale at 100% Dosage (MMLU)'\n    columns:\n    - signal\n    - Qwen-0.5B\n    - Qwen-1.5B\n    - Qwen-3B\n    rows:\n    - - Embedding Retrieval\n      - 0.75\n      - 0.73\n      - 0.69\n    - - Min-K%++\n      - 0.71\n      - 0.68\n      - 0.65\n    - - ConStat\n      - 0.69\n      - 0.67\n      - 0.63\n    - - Self-Critique\n      - 0.58\n      - 0.64\n      - 0.66\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: 4×4 AUC heatmap (signal × dosage) with color gradient from red (0.50) to\n    green (0.80). Dominated by orange/yellow tones, only top-right corner (embedding×100%)\n    reaches green. Clear dosage gradient visible in all signals.'\n  - 'Fig: Per-item score distributions (contaminated vs clean) for each signal at\n    50% dosage. Heavy overlap visible, Cohen''s d annotations all < 0.6.'\n  analysis: '这是worst档叙事的关键转折点：exp-004仿真假设AUC是exogenous input，在AUC≥0.70时identifiability成立。\n    但真实数据表明，只有embedding retrieval在100%dosage下达到0.72，其余条件下所有信号都在0.70以下。 更严重的是，信号AUC与dosage正相关——恰好在低dosage（最需要检测的regime）信号最弱。\n    这创造了一个catch-22：contamination越严重越容易检测，越轻微越不可检测， 但校准价值恰恰在轻微contamination时最高。这是reframed论文的核心洞察之一。\n\n    '\n- name: rrf_aggregation_ablation\n  plan_id: exp-003\n  description: 'RRF融合及ablation。worst档下RRF未能显著超越最佳单信号， \"互补性\"假设在真实数据上不成立。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    rrf_4signal_auc_100pct_dosage: 0.7\n    rrf_4signal_auc_50pct_dosage: 0.65\n    rrf_4signal_auc_25pct_dosage: 0.6\n    rrf_4signal_auc_5pct_dosage: 0.55\n    best_single_signal_auc_100pct: 0.72\n    rrf_vs_best_single_auc_delta_100pct: -0.02\n    rrf_vs_best_single_auc_delta_avg: 0.01\n    rank_avg_auc_100pct: 0.69\n    calibrated_weighted_rrf_auc_100pct: 0.71\n    degraded_2signal_auc_100pct: 0.64\n    degraded_2signal_auc_50pct: 0.59\n    degraded_2signal_vs_4signal_auc_gap: 0.06\n    fp_injection_robustness_auc_drop_10pct_fp: 0.04\n    fp_injection_robustness_auc_drop_20pct_fp: 0.09\n    signal_correlation_matrix_avg_pairwise_r: 0.58\n  result_rationale: 'RRF融合的理论优势依赖于信号互补性——不同信号捕获不同aspect的contamination evidence。 worst档下这一假设崩溃的原因：(1)\n    信号间pairwise correlation高达0.58（远高于独立信号假设的~0.2）， 因为所有信号本质上都在检测同一个latent变量（训练数据中是否包含该item的变体），\n    只是通过不同proxy衡量，proxy之间高度相关； (2) RRF在100%dosage下（0.70）反而低于最佳单信号embedding retrieval（0.72），\n    因为RRF等权平均了四个信号，而弱信号（Self-Critique 0.63）拖累了总体； (3) calibrated weighted RRF（0.71）通过下调弱信号权重稍有改善，但改善不显著\n    （因为最优权重在small sample下估计不稳定）； (4) 2-signal degraded mode（ConStat+Self-Critique=0.64）更糟，\n    因为这两个恰好是最弱的两个信号——closed-weight场景下的可用信号恰好是最差的。 FP injection进一步暴露了脆弱性：20% FP率下AUC下降0.09，说明信号对noise极敏感。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Aggregation Method Comparison (AUC at 100% dosage, MMLU)'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - AUC\n    - Δ vs best single\n    rows:\n    - - Embedding Retrieval (best single)\n      - 0.72\n      - —\n    - - Min-K%++\n      - 0.68\n      - -0.04\n    - - ConStat\n      - 0.66\n      - -0.06\n    - - Self-Critique\n      - 0.63\n      - -0.09\n    - - RRF (4-signal)\n      - 0.7\n      - -0.02\n    - - Rank Average (4-signal)\n      - 0.69\n      - -0.03\n    - - Weighted RRF (calibrated)\n      - 0.71\n      - -0.01\n    - - 2-signal degraded (CS+SC)\n      - 0.64\n      - -0.08\n  - name: 'Table: RRF AUC across dosage levels'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - 5%\n    - 25%\n    - 50%\n    - 100%\n    rows:\n    - - RRF 4-signal\n      - 0.55\n      - 0.6\n      - 0.65\n      - 0.7\n    - - Best single\n      - 0.54\n      - 0.62\n      - 0.68\n      - 0.72\n    - - 2-signal degraded\n      - 0.52\n      - 0.56\n      - 0.59\n      - 0.64\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Pairwise signal correlation matrix heatmap. All off-diagonal values 0.45-0.68,\n    indicating high redundancy. Embedding-MinK++ highest (0.68), Self-Critique-others\n    lowest (~0.45).'\n  - 'Fig: RRF AUC vs number of signals (1,2,3,4). Flat curve — adding signals beyond\n    the best single provides <0.02 AUC gain at any dosage. Contrasts sharply with\n    simulated independent signals.'\n  analysis: 'RRF的failure mode不是\"融合方法差\"而是\"没有足够互补的信号可融合\"。 信号correlation 0.58意味着~34%共享方差，真正独立的信息增量有限。\n    对reframed论文的贡献：这变成了\"signal diversity as identifiability prerequisite\"的实证证据—— identifiability不仅需要足够高的AUC，还需要信号间足够低的correlation。\n    当前4个信号不满足这一条件。2-signal degraded mode的糟糕表现 直接支持\"closed-weight regime下calibration不可行\"的结论。\n\n    '\n- name: noise_propagation_analysis\n  plan_id: exp-005\n  description: '噪声传播分析。worst档下暴露检测信号噪声导致CI宽度急剧膨胀， 使calibration在实用意义上失去价值。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    baseline_gamma_ci_width_pp: 18.0\n    noise_1x_gamma_ci_width_pp: 22.5\n    noise_1_5x_gamma_ci_width_pp: 28.0\n    noise_2x_gamma_ci_width_pp: 35.2\n    baseline_theta_ci_width_pp: 12.0\n    noise_1x_theta_ci_width_pp: 15.8\n    noise_1_5x_theta_ci_width_pp: 20.5\n    noise_2x_theta_ci_width_pp: 27.1\n    ci_coverage_95_at_noise_1x: 0.88\n    ci_coverage_95_at_noise_1_5x: 0.93\n    ci_coverage_95_at_noise_2x: 0.97\n    selfcritique_estimated_fp_rate: 0.35\n    selfcritique_estimated_fn_rate: 0.28\n    measurement_error_model_converged: true\n    measurement_error_model_ci_width_pp: 24.0\n    ci_width_exceeds_practical_threshold_15pp_pct: 0.78\n  result_rationale: 'noise propagation在worst档下创造了一个根本性的precision-coverage tradeoff：\n    (1) 基线CI width已经是18pp（因为信号AUC低导致γ posterior宽）， 远超可发表的\"tight calibration\"标准（<10pp）；\n    (2) Self-Critique的FP rate 35%和FN rate 28%意味着matched noise level已经很高， 1x noise\n    injection后CI膨胀至22.5pp——此时CI覆盖了绝大部分可能的score值， calibration退化为\"我们不知道真实score是多少\"的诚实但无用的声明；\n    (3) 2x noise下CI width 35pp意味着一个60%准确率的模型的95%CI覆盖[42.5%, 77.5%]—— 这个范围大到无法做任何有意义的model\n    selection； (4) coverage随noise增加而上升（从0.88到0.97）是因为CI变宽了， 不是因为calibration变好了——这是overcoverage问题，CI过于保守。\n    measurement error model收敛但CI width 24pp说明即使自动noise propagation也无法\"解决\"问题， 因为核心issue是信号本身太noisy，不是propagation方法不对。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: CI Width and Coverage under Noise Injection'\n    columns:\n    - noise_level\n    - gamma_ci_width_pp\n    - theta_ci_width_pp\n    - coverage_95%\n    - coverage_80%\n    rows:\n    - - baseline (0x)\n      - 18.0\n      - 12.0\n      - 0.82\n      - 0.68\n    - - matched (1x)\n      - 22.5\n      - 15.8\n      - 0.88\n      - 0.74\n    - - 1.5x\n      - 28.0\n      - 20.5\n      - 0.93\n      - 0.82\n    - - 2x\n      - 35.2\n      - 27.1\n      - 0.97\n      - 0.9\n    - - measurement error model\n      - 24.0\n      - 17.2\n      - 0.9\n      - 0.76\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: CI width vs noise multiplier. Near-linear relationship for γ, slightly sub-linear\n    for θ. Horizontal dashed line at 15pp marks ''practical utility threshold'' —\n    crossed at ~0.7x matched noise, meaning even below realistic noise levels CIs\n    are already too wide.'\n  - 'Fig: Coverage-Width tradeoff plot. Curve moves from undercoverage+narrow (baseline)\n    to overcoverage+wide (2x noise). No operating point achieves both nominal coverage\n    AND practical width.'\n  analysis: '这是worst档最具诊断价值的实验。它量化了\"信号噪声→calibration无用\"的精确pathway。 核心发现可以被表述为noise\n    amplification theorem的实证版本： 当检测信号AUC < 0.70时，IRT模型的noise propagation使calibrated\n    CI width超过15pp， 此时calibration不具备practical decision value。 对reframed论文的贡献：这直接支持identifiability\n    boundary的operational定义—— 不仅是\"能否估计γ\"（statistical identifiability），还是\"估计的γ是否有用\"（practical\n    identifiability）。 引入15pp practical threshold将identifiability map从binary升级为graded。\n\n    '\n- name: irt_calibration_and_baselines\n  plan_id: exp-006\n  description: '核心calibration实验——4PL+γ IRT拟合及5个baselines比较。 worst档下4PL+γ不显著优于简单baselines。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    calibration_mae_4pl_gamma_pp: 7.8\n    calibration_mae_remove_rescore_pp: 8.1\n    calibration_mae_single_signal_2pl_gamma_pp: 7.5\n    calibration_mae_vanilla_4pl_pp: 9.2\n    calibration_mae_linear_regression_pp: 7.2\n    calibration_mae_emperor_mitigation_pp: 8.9\n    margin_4pl_gamma_vs_best_baseline_mae_relative: 0.08\n    ci_coverage_95_4pl_gamma: 0.78\n    ci_coverage_80_4pl_gamma: 0.62\n    ci_coverage_50_4pl_gamma: 0.38\n    ci_width_95_avg_pp: 19.5\n    ci_width_80_avg_pp: 14.2\n    kendall_tau_4pl_gamma: 0.62\n    kendall_tau_linear_regression: 0.65\n    kendall_tau_vanilla_4pl: 0.58\n    dose_response_spearman: 0.55\n    dose_response_monotonic: false\n    dose_response_5pct_gamma_ci_includes_zero: true\n    dose_response_25pct_gamma_ci_includes_zero: true\n    dose_response_100pct_gamma_significant: true\n    gamma_theta_posterior_correlation: 0.52\n    gamma_rel_bias_avg: 0.35\n    gamma_95ci_includes_zero_pct_conditions: 0.55\n    paired_ttest_4pl_gamma_vs_linear_pvalue: 0.23\n    paired_ttest_4pl_gamma_vs_remove_rescore_pvalue: 0.41\n    stan_rhat_max: 1.08\n    stan_divergent_pct: 3.2\n    stan_ess_min: 180\n  result_rationale: '这是worst档的核心实验，calibration claim在这里正式崩溃： (1) 4PL+γ MAE 7.8pp看似reasonable，但linear\n    regression以7.2pp击败它—— 更简单的模型反而更好，因为IRT的复杂参数化（a,b,c,d,γ五个参数/item）在small sample下过拟合，\n    而linear regression的regularization更有效； (2) single-signal 2PL+γ（7.5pp）也优于full 4PL+γ，说明additional\n    IRT complexity（c,d参数） 反而引入了estimation noise而非提供更好的fit； (3) γ-θ posterior correlation\n    0.52直接confirm了identifiability问题—— 模型无法区分\"模型能力高\"和\"模型被contaminate了\"，因为在我们的数据中 这两者确实相关（更大的模型被更多地contaminate，或者更capable的模型从contamination中获益更多）；\n    (4) dose-response非单调：5%和25%的γ CI包含0，只有100%显著—— 这意味着模型只能检测\"极端contamination\"，对\"轻微到中度contamination\"无能为力；\n    (5) CI coverage 78%严重undercoverage（nominal 95%），说明posterior CI低估了不确定性， 这与noise\n    propagation实验一致——模型没有正确传播信号噪声； (6) Stan diagnostics出现3.2% divergences和R-hat 1.08，暗示posterior\n    geometry有问题， 可能因为γ-θ near-unidentifiable导致posterior funnel/ridge。 所有pairwise significance\n    tests p>0.05，确认4PL+γ不具备统计显著优势。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Calibration MAE (pp) by Method × Benchmark'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - MMLU\n    - GSM8K\n    - ARC-C\n    - HumanEval\n    - Average\n    rows:\n    - - 4PL+γ (ours)\n      - 6.5\n      - 9.2\n      - 7.1\n      - 8.4\n      - 7.8\n    - - Remove-rescore\n      - 7.2\n      - 8.8\n      - 7.5\n      - 8.9\n      - 8.1\n    - - Single-signal 2PL+γ\n      - 6.2\n      - 8.5\n      - 7.0\n      - 8.3\n      - 7.5\n    - - Vanilla 4PL\n      - 8.1\n      - 10.5\n      - 8.8\n      - 9.4\n      - 9.2\n    - - Linear regression+CI\n      - 5.8\n      - 8.2\n      - 6.9\n      - 7.9\n      - 7.2\n    - - Emperor mitigation\n      - 7.8\n      - 10.2\n      - 8.2\n      - 9.4\n      - 8.9\n  - name: 'Table: Interval Quality Metrics'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - Coverage 95%\n    - Coverage 80%\n    - Width 95% (pp)\n    - Kendall τ\n    rows:\n    - - 4PL+γ\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.62\n      - 19.5\n      - 0.62\n    - - Linear regression+CI\n      - 0.83\n      - 0.7\n      - 16.2\n      - 0.65\n    - - Single-signal 2PL+γ\n      - 0.8\n      - 0.65\n      - 17.8\n      - 0.6\n  - name: 'Table: Dose-Response γ Estimates'\n    columns:\n    - dosage\n    - gamma_mean\n    - gamma_95ci_lower\n    - gamma_95ci_upper\n    - ci_excludes_zero\n    rows:\n    - - 5%\n      - 0.04\n      - -0.18\n      - 0.26\n      - false\n    - - 25%\n      - 0.11\n      - -0.08\n      - 0.31\n      - false\n    - - 50%\n      - 0.22\n      - 0.01\n      - 0.44\n      - true\n    - - 100%\n      - 0.38\n      - 0.12\n      - 0.65\n      - true\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: MAE bar chart with 95% bootstrap CIs across methods. 4PL+γ bar overlaps\n    with linear regression and single-signal 2PL+γ CIs. No method achieves separation.\n    Vanilla 4PL and Emperor mitigation clearly worse but that''s a low bar.'\n  - 'Fig: Calibration plot (predicted vs true clean accuracy). 4PL+γ shows high-dosage\n    points calibrated but low-dosage points clustered near identity line (no correction\n    applied because γ≈0). Linear regression shows more uniform correction.'\n  - 'Fig: γ posterior density plots by dosage. 5% and 25% posteriors centered near\n    zero with wide tails. 50% barely significant. Only 100% shows clear separation\n    from zero.'\n  - 'Fig: γ-θ posterior scatter plot showing 0.52 correlation. Banana-shaped posterior\n    indicating identifiability ridge.'\n  analysis: '这是worst档论文reframing的smoking gun实验。三个关键takeaways： (1) IRT complexity不付费——linear\n    regression+bootstrap CI以更少参数达到更好MAE和coverage， 说明在当前信号质量下，复杂模型的额外表达力被estimation\n    noise吞噬； (2) γ的identifiability是dosage-dependent的——只有极端contamination可被检测和校正， 这严重限制了实用价值（现实中contamination不可能是100%）；\n    (3) undercoverage说明Bayesian CI名义上的\"uncertainty quantification\"实际上overconfident，\n    这是因为model misspecification（additive γ假设）而非posterior approximation问题。 Reframed论文角度：这些结果精确对应了exp-004仿真预测的identifiability\n    boundary—— 真实AUC~0.65-0.70恰好在仿真中identifiability开始崩溃的区域， 构成\"仿真边界与真实数据吻合\"的核心evidence。\n\n    '\n- name: scale_bridging_7b\n  plan_id: exp-007\n  description: 'Qwen2.5-7B 5个dosage level的controlled SFT。worst档下scale-up不仅未改善， 反而加剧了γ-θ\n    confounding。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    sft_runs_completed: 5\n    mmlu_score_inflation_100pct_pp: 4.5\n    mmlu_score_inflation_50pct_pp: 2.8\n    mmlu_score_inflation_5pct_pp: 0.4\n    gsm8k_score_inflation_100pct_pp: 2.9\n    signal_auc_embedding_100pct: 0.66\n    signal_auc_minkpp_100pct: 0.62\n    gamma_estimate_100pct: 0.25\n    gamma_ci_includes_zero_100pct: false\n    gamma_ci_includes_zero_50pct: true\n    calibration_mae_4pl_gamma_pp: 8.5\n    calibration_mae_linear_regression_pp: 7.8\n    gamma_theta_posterior_corr: 0.58\n    inflation_vs_3b_ratio: 0.55\n  result_rationale: '7B模型在worst档下表现更差而非更好，原因： (1) 更大模型的pretraining knowledge已经覆盖了更多benchmark\n    knowledge， SFT injection的边际效应递减——inflation仅4.5pp vs 0.5B的11.5pp； (2) 更小的inflation意味着detection\n    signal的SNR更低（AUC从0.72降至0.66）， 因为contamination signal被更大模型的\"naturally knowing the\n    answer\"所掩盖—— 这是worst档的核心confounding：能力高的模型天然就会答对contaminated items， detection信号无法区分\"因为contamination答对\"和\"因为能力高答对\"；\n    (3) γ-θ posterior correlation升至0.58（vs 0.5B/1.5B/3B的0.52）， confirm了scale与identifiability的反相关关系；\n    (4) calibration MAE反而上升到8.5pp，因为7B的inflation小（校正需求低）， 但estimation noise不变甚至更大（因为signal\n    AUC更低），导致noise-to-signal ratio恶化。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: 7B vs 3B Comparison at 100% Dosage'\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - Qwen-3B\n    - Qwen-7B\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU inflation (pp)\n      - 5.2\n      - 4.5\n    - - Embedding AUC\n      - 0.69\n      - 0.66\n    - - γ estimate\n      - 0.34\n      - 0.25\n    - - γ-θ posterior corr\n      - 0.52\n      - 0.58\n    - - Calibration MAE (pp)\n      - 7.8\n      - 8.5\n    - - CI width 95% (pp)\n      - 19.5\n      - 22.0\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Scale vs identifiability plot. X-axis: model params (0.5B to 7B). Y-axis:\n    γ relative bias and signal AUC. Both metrics degrade with scale, showing inverse\n    relationship between model capability and calibration feasibility.'\n  analysis: '7B实验提供了worst档最重要的scaling insight：calibration difficulty与model scale正相关。\n    这不是方法的failure而是problem structure的fundamental property—— 更强的模型天然掩盖contamination\n    signal。 对reframed论文：这是identifiability boundary的第三个维度（signal quality × model count\n    × model scale）， 且是最novel的——之前的identifiability分析没有考虑\"ability confounds detection\"。\n\n    '\n- name: signal_survival_analysis\n  plan_id: exp-008\n  description: 'Detection signal在不同training regime下的survival分析。 worst档下确认SFT后信号已经脆弱，RL后几乎完全失效。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    auc_heatmap:\n      base_embedding: 0.78\n      base_minkpp: 0.73\n      base_constat: 0.71\n      base_selfcritique: 0.6\n      sft_clean_embedding: 0.72\n      sft_clean_minkpp: 0.65\n      sft_clean_constat: 0.63\n      sft_clean_selfcritique: 0.58\n      sft_contam_embedding: 0.72\n      sft_contam_minkpp: 0.68\n      sft_contam_constat: 0.66\n      sft_contam_selfcritique: 0.63\n      rl_embedding: 0.6\n      rl_minkpp: 0.55\n      rl_constat: 0.53\n      rl_selfcritique: 0.57\n    signal_survival_rate_sft_avg: 0.88\n    signal_survival_rate_rl_avg: 0.73\n    rl_best_signal: selfcritique\n    rl_best_signal_auc: 0.57\n    rl_all_signals_below_070: true\n    sft_clean_contam_auc_difference_avg: 0.03\n    regime_effect_anova_pvalue: 0.002\n  result_rationale: 'signal survival分析在worst档下揭示了检测信号的systematic fragility： (1) Base\n    model上信号最强（embedding 0.78），但这个\"最佳条件\"在实践中不存在—— 没有人在base model上做benchmark evaluation，所有评估都在post-trained\n    model上； (2) SFT（无论clean还是contaminated）使所有信号平均下降12%—— 这是因为SFT改变了model representation\n    space，token-level信号（Min-K%++）受影响最大， 而embedding retrieval因为不依赖model内部状态反而最稳定； (3)\n    RL regime是灾难性的：所有信号AUC降至0.60以下或刚到0.60—— RL的reward hacking改变了model的输出distribution（更confident、更formulaic），\n    使得基于distribution shift的检测（Min-K%++, ConStat）几乎失效； (4) Self-Critique在RL regime下反而成为\"最佳信号\"（0.57），但仅因为其他信号更差——\n    0.57的AUC几乎没有实用价值（sensitivity+specificity之和刚过1.0）； (5) SFT clean vs contaminated的AUC差异仅0.03，说明信号的下降主要由post-training本身\n    而非contamination引起——信号检测的是\"training变化\"而非\"contamination变化\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Signal × Regime AUC Heatmap'\n    columns:\n    - signal\n    - Base\n    - SFT-Clean\n    - SFT-Contam\n    - RL\n    rows:\n    - - Embedding Retrieval\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.72\n      - 0.72\n      - 0.6\n    - - Min-K%++\n      - 0.73\n      - 0.65\n      - 0.68\n      - 0.55\n    - - ConStat\n      - 0.71\n      - 0.63\n      - 0.66\n      - 0.53\n    - - Self-Critique\n      - 0.6\n      - 0.58\n      - 0.63\n      - 0.57\n  - name: 'Table: Signal Survival Rate (AUC retention relative to Base)'\n    columns:\n    - signal\n    - SFT-Clean\n    - SFT-Contam\n    - RL\n    rows:\n    - - Embedding Retrieval\n      - 0.92\n      - 0.92\n      - 0.77\n    - - Min-K%++\n      - 0.89\n      - 0.93\n      - 0.75\n    - - ConStat\n      - 0.89\n      - 0.93\n      - 0.75\n    - - Self-Critique\n      - 0.97\n      - 1.05\n      - 0.95\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: 4×4 heatmap with color coding. Clear left-to-right degradation gradient.\n    RL column almost uniformly orange/red. Self-Critique row most stable (highest\n    retention) but starts lowest.'\n  - 'Fig: Survival curves plotting AUC retention across regimes. Embedding and Min-K++\n    show steep RL drop. Self-Critique nearly flat but at low absolute level — ''stable\n    but weak''.'\n  analysis: '这个实验在reframed论文中升级为Core Contribution之一。关键叙事： \"Current detection signals\n    were designed for and evaluated on base/SFT models. We show that post-training\n    — especially RL — systematically degrades all signals below the identifiability\n    threshold established in our simulation study (exp-004).\" Self-Critique的\"stability\"是pyrrhic——它稳定在0.57-0.63的range，从未达到可用水平。\n    这直接支持\"RL regime下calibration不可行\"的结论，且解释了为什么： 不是方法不对，而是信号不存在。\n\n    '\n- name: rl_observational_case_study\n  plan_id: exp-009\n  description: 'RL-trained models的观察性案例研究。worst档下calibration在RL regime中几乎完全失效， expected\n    regret reduction接近零甚至为负。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    models_evaluated: 8\n    selfcritique_auc_avg_rl: 0.57\n    rrf_auc_avg_rl: 0.59\n    calibration_mae_4pl_gamma_pp: 10.5\n    calibration_mae_uncalibrated_pp: 9.8\n    calibration_mae_remove_rescore_pp: 9.2\n    ci_width_95_avg_pp: 24.5\n    ci_coverage_95: 0.82\n    expected_regret_reduction_vs_uncalibrated: -0.03\n    expected_regret_reduction_vs_remove_rescore: -0.08\n    top5_model_selection_agreement_with_true: 0.6\n    gamma_estimates_mean: 0.08\n    gamma_ci_includes_zero_pct: 0.85\n    nearzero_gamma_clean_benchmark_check: true\n    nearzero_gamma_clean_value: 0.02\n    deepseek_r1_gamma_ci_includes_zero: true\n  result_rationale: 'RL observational case study是worst档中最清晰的negative result： (1) Signal\n    AUC在RL regime下仅0.57-0.59（exp-008已预测），这意味着exposure scores 几乎是noise，输入到IRT模型中的是garbage-in；\n    (2) 4PL+γ MAE 10.5pp反而比uncalibrated的9.8pp更差—— 模型在noisy exposure scores上\"hallucinate\"了不存在的contamination\n    effect， 做出了比不校正更差的adjustment（overcorrection on false positives，undercorrection\n    on true positives）； (3) expected regret reduction为-0.03（vs uncalibrated）和-0.08（vs\n    remove-rescore）， 即calibration使model selection决策变差了——这是因为宽CI（24.5pp）导致model rankings变得更noisy，\n    而uncalibrated scores虽然biased但至少preserves ranking well； (4) 85%的conditions下γ CI包含零，说明模型在RL\n    regime下根本检测不到contamination—— 不是\"检测到了但校正不够\"，而是\"γ与zero不可区分\"； (5) 唯一的positive result是specificity\n    check通过——clean benchmark上γ≈0.02， 说明模型至少没有在clean data上产生false positive contamination\n    detection。 但这是一个低门槛的成功。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: RL Case Study — Calibration Method Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - MAE_pp\n    - CI Width 95%\n    - Coverage 95%\n    - Regret Reduction\n    rows:\n    - - Uncalibrated (naive)\n      - 9.8\n      - —\n      - —\n      - —\n    - - 4PL+γ\n      - 10.5\n      - 24.5\n      - 0.82\n      - -0.03\n    - - Remove-rescore\n      - 9.2\n      - —\n      - —\n      - —\n    - - Linear regression+CI\n      - 9.9\n      - 21.0\n      - 0.85\n      - 0.01\n  - name: 'Table: Per-Model γ Estimates (RL models)'\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - gamma_mean\n    - gamma_95ci_lower\n    - gamma_95ci_upper\n    - ci_excludes_zero\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct\n      - 0.12\n      - -0.15\n      - 0.39\n      - false\n    - - Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct\n      - 0.08\n      - -0.18\n      - 0.34\n      - false\n    - - Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct\n      - 0.05\n      - -0.21\n      - 0.31\n      - false\n    - - Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\n      - 0.03\n      - -0.25\n      - 0.31\n      - false\n    - - DeepSeek-R1-Distill-1.5B\n      - 0.1\n      - -0.14\n      - 0.34\n      - false\n    - - DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B\n      - 0.06\n      - -0.2\n      - 0.32\n      - false\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Expected regret curves. X-axis: number of models selected. Y-axis: expected\n    regret. Uncalibrated line sits below 4PL+γ line across all selection sizes. Thin\n    gray lines show bootstrap replicates — high variance, no consistent winner.'\n  - 'Fig: γ forest plot for all RL models. All CIs cross zero. Horizontal span of\n    CIs (~0.5) dwarfs point estimates (~0.05-0.12).'\n  analysis: 'RL case study提供了worst档最dramatic的result：calibration不仅不帮忙，还hurt。 这是因为在signal\n    quality低于identifiability threshold时，IRT模型的额外参数 成为了pure noise amplifier。对reframed论文的贡献有两层：\n    (1) Empirical confirmation that RL regime falls below identifiability boundary;\n    (2) Practical recommendation — \"do not attempt calibration when signal AUC < 0.60\"。\n    Specificity check的通过（clean γ≈0）是一个consolation prize—— 模型不产生false contamination\n    detection，但也检测不到real contamination。\n\n    '\n- name: prior_sensitivity\n  plan_id: exp-010\n  description: 'Prior sensitivity分析。worst档下结果对prior选择异常敏感， 暴露了model specification的fragility。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    gamma_prior_n01_mae_pp: 7.8\n    gamma_prior_n005_mae_pp: 9.5\n    gamma_prior_n02_mae_pp: 7.2\n    gamma_prior_n005_gamma_mean_shrinkage_ratio: 0.45\n    gamma_prior_n02_gamma_mean_inflation_ratio: 1.35\n    mae_sensitivity_range_pp: 2.3\n    ci_coverage_sensitivity_range: 0.12\n    ci_coverage_n005: 0.85\n    ci_coverage_n01: 0.78\n    ci_coverage_n02: 0.72\n    prior_sensitivity_index: 0.38\n  result_rationale: 'prior sensitivity在worst档下远超acceptable水平： (1) N(0,0.5) tight prior强制γ向零shrink\n    45%，产生undercorrection但paradoxically 提高了coverage（0.85 vs 0.78），因为tight prior限制了CI的overconfidence；\n    (2) N(0,2) wide prior允许γ inflate 35%，MAE改善（7.2pp）但coverage恶化至0.72， 因为wider prior导致posterior更受likelihood影响，而likelihood在noisy\n    data上是misleading的； (3) MAE sensitivity range 2.3pp（across prior choices）占MAE值的~30%——\n    这意味着结果高度依赖modeler的prior choice，而不是data-driven； (4) 理想情况下（信号好、sample大），Bayesian方法应该prior-insensitive——\n    sensitivity本身就是under-identification的symptom，因为data不够informative来override prior。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Prior Sensitivity Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - prior\n    - gamma_mean\n    - MAE_pp\n    - Coverage 95%\n    - CI Width 95% (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - N(0, 0.5)\n      - 0.22\n      - 9.5\n      - 0.85\n      - 15.2\n    - - N(0, 1.0) [default]\n      - 0.38\n      - 7.8\n      - 0.78\n      - 19.5\n    - - N(0, 2.0)\n      - 0.51\n      - 7.2\n      - 0.72\n      - 24.8\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: γ posterior distributions under three priors (overlaid density plots). Wide\n    separation between posteriors — data does not dominate prior. Clear visual evidence\n    of under-identification.'\n  analysis: 'Prior sensitivity ≥ 30% of point estimate confirms that the model is\n    in an under-identified regime. 对reframed论文：这直接maps到exp-004 identifiability sweep中的\"prior\n    sensitivity\"维度， 验证了仿真预测——在AUC<0.70时prior choice matters more than data.\n\n    '\n- name: few_examinee_regime\n  plan_id: exp-011\n  description: 'Few-examinee regime仿真研究。worst档下即使使用Growing Pains pre-estimation策略，\n    N<50时identifiability完全崩溃。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n20_gamma_rmse: 0.42\n    n20_gamma_rel_bias: 0.55\n    n20_theta_corr: 0.58\n    n20_ci_coverage_95: 0.68\n    n50_gamma_rmse: 0.28\n    n50_gamma_rel_bias: 0.38\n    n50_theta_corr: 0.72\n    n50_ci_coverage_95: 0.75\n    n100_gamma_rmse: 0.18\n    n100_gamma_rel_bias: 0.25\n    n100_theta_corr: 0.82\n    n100_ci_coverage_95: 0.8\n    n200_gamma_rmse: 0.12\n    n200_gamma_rel_bias: 0.18\n    n200_theta_corr: 0.88\n    n200_ci_coverage_95: 0.85\n    growing_pains_pretrain_improvement_n20_pct: 15\n    growing_pains_pretrain_improvement_n50_pct: 10\n    minimum_n_for_gamma_significant: 80\n    minimum_n_for_coverage_nominal: 150\n  result_rationale: 'few-examinee regime在worst档下与信号质量问题叠加： (1) N=20（现实中常见——很多benchmark只有20-50个models被评估）时，\n    γ RMSE 0.42，rel_bias 55%，θ与ground truth correlation仅0.58—— 此时模型参数估计本质上是noise；\n    (2) Growing Pains pre-estimation策略（借用大pool的item参数先验）仅改善15%， 因为bottleneck不是item参数估计而是γ-θ的joint\n    estimation—— item参数可以借用外部信息，但γ-θ的confounding是data-inherent的，无法靠先验缓解； (3) 达到γ显著（即CI排除零）需要N≥80，达到nominal\n    coverage需要N≥150—— 这两个threshold在realistic benchmark evaluation scenarios中很难满足 （HELM有~100\n    models，但大部分benchmarks的evaluated model count远少于此）； (4) 即使N=200，在worst档的信号质量下（AUC~0.65-0.70），\n    gamma_rel_bias仍有18%，coverage仅85%——仍未达到publishable quality。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Identifiability Metrics by Model Count (AUC=0.65)'\n    columns:\n    - N\n    - gamma_RMSE\n    - gamma_rel_bias\n    - theta_corr\n    - Coverage 95%\n    - Growing Pains Δ\n    rows:\n    - - 20\n      - 0.42\n      - 55%\n      - 0.58\n      - 68%\n      - +15%\n    - - 50\n      - 0.28\n      - 38%\n      - 0.72\n      - 75%\n      - +10%\n    - - 100\n      - 0.18\n      - 25%\n      - 0.82\n      - 80%\n      - +5%\n    - - 200\n      - 0.12\n      - 18%\n      - 0.88\n      - 85%\n      - +3%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Identifiability surface — X: model count, Y: signal AUC, Z: γ relative bias\n    (color-coded). Clear ridge at AUC≈0.70 below which no amount of models helps sufficiently.\n    The ''green zone'' (rel_bias<10%) requires AUC>0.80 AND N>100.'\n  analysis: '这个仿真扩展与exp-004共同构成identifiability map的完整版本。 关键新发现：model count和signal\n    AUC是multiplicative而非additive—— 在AUC<0.70时，增加N的边际收益急剧递减（从N=100到N=200，改善仅7pp rel_bias）。\n    这意味着\"收集更多模型\"不是解决identifiability的viable path when signals are weak。 对论文：\"minimum\n    signal quality targets for future work\"可以被具体化为AUC×N的joint requirement。\n\n    '\n- name: observational_72b\n  plan_id: exp-012\n  description: 'Qwen2.5-72B观察性分析。worst档下大模型的信号质量进一步下降， confirm了scale-identifiability的inverse\n    relationship。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    signal_auc_embedding: 0.6\n    signal_auc_minkpp: 0.56\n    signal_auc_constat: 0.54\n    signal_auc_selfcritique: 0.58\n    rrf_auc: 0.59\n    gamma_estimate: 0.04\n    gamma_ci_includes_zero: true\n    gamma_ci_width: 0.55\n    calibration_mae_pp: 11.2\n    ci_width_95_pp: 26.0\n  result_rationale: '72B模型将scale问题推向极端： (1) 72B的pretraining corpus几乎必然包含了benchmark\n    items的某种形式—— 不是传统意义的\"contamination\"而是\"知识覆盖\"，这使得所有detection signals的false positive\n    rate极高， embedding retrieval AUC降至0.60因为模型legitimately \"knows\" the content； (2)\n    γ estimate 0.04几乎为零，不是因为没有contamination而是因为unable to detect it—— 信号noise完全淹没了any\n    real signal； (3) 11.2pp MAE是worst档中最差的calibration error，因为72B的行为与smaller models\n    系统性不同（different error patterns, different item difficulty ordering）， IRT的transferability\n    across scales受到根本挑战。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: 72B Observational Results'\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - Qwen-72B\n    - Qwen-7B (controlled)\n    - Qwen-3B (controlled)\n    rows:\n    - - Best signal AUC\n      - 0.6\n      - 0.66\n      - 0.69\n    - - RRF AUC\n      - 0.59\n      - 0.63\n      - 0.67\n    - - γ estimate\n      - 0.04\n      - 0.25\n      - 0.34\n    - - γ CI excludes zero\n      - false\n      - Marginal (50%)\n      - true\n    - - Calibration MAE (pp)\n      - 11.2\n      - 8.5\n      - 7.8\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Scale vs signal AUC trend line from 0.5B to 72B. Clear monotonic decrease.\n    Horizontal dashed line at AUC=0.70 crossed between 1.5B and 3B scale. 72B is deep\n    in the ''unidentifiable'' zone.'\n  analysis: '72B结果是identifiability boundary story的natural endpoint： 在frontier model\n    scale上，calibration方法论本身不适用，因为\"contamination\"和\"knowledge\" 在概念层面就难以区分。这是reframed论文的strong\n    closing argument—— \"our identifiability analysis reveals that contamination-aware\n    calibration faces a fundamental scale barrier: the very models most in need of\n    calibration (large, widely trained) are precisely those where calibration is least\n    feasible.\"\n\n    '\n- name: closed_weight_2signal_mode\n  plan_id: exp-013\n  description: '2-signal degraded mode (ConStat + Self-Critique) for closed-weight\n    models. worst档下降级模式使calibration完全不可行。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    two_signal_rrf_auc_100pct_dosage: 0.64\n    two_signal_rrf_auc_50pct_dosage: 0.58\n    two_signal_rrf_auc_25pct_dosage: 0.54\n    calibration_mae_2signal_pp: 10.8\n    calibration_mae_4signal_pp: 7.8\n    mae_increase_relative_2_vs_4_signal: 0.38\n    ci_width_95_2signal_pp: 25.2\n    ci_coverage_95_2signal: 0.75\n    kendall_tau_2signal: 0.48\n    gamma_ci_includes_zero_2signal_pct: 0.72\n  result_rationale: '2-signal mode在worst档下是最差的配置： (1) ConStat和Self-Critique恰好是四个信号中AUC最低的两个（exp-002），\n    它们的fusion AUC 0.64远低于identifiability threshold 0.70； (2) MAE增加38%（从7.8pp到10.8pp），符合worst档的two_signal_degraded_mae_increase_relative范围[0.35,\n    0.6]； (3) Kendall τ降至0.48——低于0.5意味着calibrated rankings与true rankings的agreement\n    不比random好多少，calibration实际上在扰乱而非改善rankings； (4) 72%的conditions下γ CI包含零，说明在closed-weight\n    scenario下 contamination detection几乎完全不可行。 这是因为closed-weight模型不提供logits和embeddings，而这两个恰好是信号质量最高的信息源——\n    没有它们，剩余信号不足以支撑any meaningful calibration。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: 2-Signal vs 4-Signal Calibration Gap'\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - 4-signal\n    - 2-signal\n    - degradation\n    rows:\n    - - RRF AUC (100%)\n      - 0.7\n      - 0.64\n      - -8.6%\n    - - MAE (pp)\n      - 7.8\n      - 10.8\n      - +38%\n    - - CI Width 95% (pp)\n      - 19.5\n      - 25.2\n      - +29%\n    - - Kendall τ\n      - 0.62\n      - 0.48\n      - -23%\n    - - Coverage 95%\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.75\n      - -3.8%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Side-by-side calibration error distributions (4-signal vs 2-signal). 2-signal\n    distribution shifted right with heavier tail. Overlap region highlighted — some\n    conditions where 2-signal accidentally performs okay, but median is significantly\n    worse.'\n  analysis: '2-signal degraded mode的failure confirm了一个important practical constraint：\n    closed-weight models（GPT-4, Claude等）——恰好是most scrutinized for contamination——\n    是calibration最不可行的targets。 对reframed论文：identifiability map需要一个新维度——\"signal access\n    level\" (full access: 4 signals; closed-weight: 2 signals)， 2-signal在identifiability\n    map上的viable region极小（仅AUC>0.80且N>150，现实中不存在）。'\n","numLines":1132,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1132}}}
