Future of Peer Review\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/html/2510.08867v1\"},{\"title\":\"AAAI 2026 First-Round Results: High Scores Rejected, AI Reviews Useful? | CSPaper Forum\",\"url\":\"https://forum.cspaper.org/topic/154/aaai-2026-first-round-results-high-scores-rejected-ai-reviews-useful\"},{\"title\":\"AAAI 2026 Accepted Papers: Outstanding Papers, Research Trends & Full Highlights\",\"url\":\"https://www.bohrium.com/en/blog/research-notes/aaai-2026-accepted-papers-highlights/\"},{\"title\":\"AAAI 2026 Conference | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/group?id=AAAI.org%2F2026%2FConference\"},{\"title\":\"🔥 Gearing Up for AAAI 2026: What You Need to Know to Win the Game | CSPaper Forum\",\"url\":\"https://forum.cspaper.org/topic/47/gearing-up-for-aaai-2026-what-you-need-to-know-to-win-the-game\"},{\"title\":\"IAAI-26 Call - AAAI\",\"url\":\"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/iaai-26-call/\"},{\"title\":\"Reviewer Instructions\",\"url\":\"https://docs.google.com/document/u/0/d/1tqQGwtNUlALPSTqoTo5uTFx8vKuqpILNTne9jeBCOVI/mobilebasic\"}]\n\nBased on my web search results, I found information about AAAI 2026's review process, but the specific 1-10 scoring scale rubric with detailed rating criteria is not fully available in the search results. However, I can share what I found:\n\nFor 2026, AAAI adopted a hybrid review system: three human reviewers plus one AI-generated review. Evidence from the review results shows that papers were scored on a numerical scale, as researchers reported cases of high-score rejections (e.g., 7/6/5; 8/6/6; 7/6/6) and papers with average scores of 5.5–6.5 being rejected, with some scoring as high as 6.7.\n\nAdditionally, the AI review will not include any ratings or recommendations, as an experiment for the pilot program, meaning that while human reviewers provided numeric scores, the AI-generated reviews did not.\n\nUnfortunately, the search results do not contain the detailed scoring rubric that explains what each numerical score (1-10) specifically means in terms of paper quality and acceptance criteria. To get the full scoring scale and criteria details, you would need to access the official \"Instructions for AAAI-26 Reviewers\" page directly from the AAAI website, which appears to exist but the full content was not available in my search results.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cf7713ee-84a1-45ab-aa08-0b655cc1ab71","uuid":"83b28a92-b030-4f20-9947-4b00e654b0b0","timestamp":"2026-05-13T16:39:39.021Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"AAAI 2026 reviewer scoring scale 1-10 overall assessment rating criteria","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_019RaExS6gbmVM5ub9VxfW1z","content":[{"title":"Instructions for AAAI-26 Reviewers - AAAI","url":"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/instructions-for-aaai-26-reviewers/"},{"title":"AAAI-26 Review Process Update: Scale, Integrity Measures, and Pathways to Sustainability - AAAI","url":"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/review-process-update/"},{"title":"Overview of the AI Review System","url":"https://aaai.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/FAQ-for-the-AI-Assisted-Peer-Review-Process-Pilot-Program.pdf"},{"title":"AAAI-26 Review Process - AAAI","url":"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/review-process/"},{"title":"AAAI 2026 Statistics - Paper Copilot","url":"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/aaai-statistics/aaai-2026-statistics/"},{"title":"AI-Assisted Peer Review at Scale: The AAAI-26 AI Review Pilot","url":"https://arxiv.org/html/2604.13940v1"},{"title":"AAAI 2026 | OpenReview","url":"https://openreview.net/group?id=AAAI.org%2F2026"},{"title":"AAAI Statistics - Paper Copilot","url":"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/aaai-statistics/"},{"title":"AAAI 2025 Statistics - Paper Copilot","url":"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/aaai-statistics/aaai-2025-statistics/"},{"title":"🎉 AAAI 2026 Review Results & Rebuttal Phase — 