s: 60\n39\t    columns:\n40\t    - model\n41\t    - benchmark\n42\t    - dosage\n43\t    - clean_acc\n44\t    - contaminated_acc\n45\t    - inflation_pp\n46\t  figures_description:\n47\t  - 'Fig 1: Dose-response curves (dosage vs inflation) for each model×benchmark combination,\n48\t    12 panels, showing strict monotonicity'\n49\t  analysis: '所有15个SFT run成功收敛。inflation幅度在MMLU上与文献一致。 关键观察：inflation并非线性——25%→50%的增量大于5%→25%，表明contamination效果存在加速区间，\n50\t    支持非线性4PL建模的必要性。跨benchmark一致性强，为Claim 1提供坚实的ground truth基础。"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01ANshdtSqT7wStqDUHGRzSm","session_id":"cf7713ee-84a1-45ab-aa08-0b655cc1ab71","uuid":"18ad3edf-7018-4421-9f26-2c58b82d9dde","timestamp":"2026-05-13T16:43:13.792Z"}
